hadiths[190]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5042","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik qaari ko raat ke waqt masjid mein Quran Majeed padhtey huey suna to farmaya ke Allah us aadmi par raham karey usne mujhey falan-falan aayatein yad dila diin jinhein maine falan-falan Suraton mein se chhod rakha tha."
"5043","ham unki khidmat mein subah sawerey hazir huey. haaziriin mein se aik sahib ne kaha ke raat maine (tamaam) mufassal soortein padh daaliin. is par Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) boley jaisey ashaar jaldi-jaldi padhtey hain tum ne waisey hi padh li hogi. ham se qirat suni hai aur mujhey wo jod wali soortein bhi yad hain jinko mila kar namazon mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) padha kartey they. ye atthaara soortein mufassal ki hain aur wo 2 soortein jinke shuru main ( حم‏ ( hai."
"5044","Allah Taala ke farmaan ( لا تحرك به لسانك لتعجل به ) '' aap Quran ko jaldi jaldii leney ke liye is par zaban ko na hilaayaa karein.'' bayan kya ke jab Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) wahi lekar nazil hotey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni zaban aur hont hilaayaa kartey they. uski wjah se aap ke liye wahi yad karne mein bahut baar padta tha aur ye aap ke chehrey se bhi zahir ho jata tha. isliye Allah Taala ne ye aayat jo sura ( لا أقسم بيوم القيامة‏ ( mein hai, nazil ki ke aap Quran ko jaldi jaldii leney ke liye is par zaban ko na hilaayaa karein ye to hamarey zimme hai iska jama karna aur iska padhwaanaa to jab ham usey padhney lagein to aap iske peechhey peechhey padha karein phir aap ki zaban se uski tafseer bayan kara dena bhi hamarey zimme hai.'' rawi ne bayan kya ke phir jab Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) aatey to aap sar jhukaa letey aur jab wapas jatey to padhtey jaisa ke Allah ne aap se yad karwaaney ka wada kya tha ke terey dil mein jama dena usko padha dena hamara kaam hai phir aap iske muwafiq padhtey ."
"5045","maine Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki tilawat Quran Majeed ke mutaalliq sawal kya to unhon-ne batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un alfaz ko kheench kar padhtey they jin mein mudd hota tha."
"5046","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qirat kaisi thi? unhon-ne bayan kya ke mudd ke saath. phir aap ne ( بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم ( padha aur kaha ke) بسم الله ( (main Allah ki Lam ( ko mudd ke sath padhtey ( الرحمن ( (main meem) ko mudd ke sath padhtey aur) الرحيم‏ .) (main حاء ko) mudd ke sath padhtey ."
"5047","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni ontni ya oont par Sawar ho kar tilawat kar rahe they sawari chal rahi thi aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sura fateh padh rahe they ya ( rawi ne ye bayan kya ke) sura fateh mein se padh rahe they narmii aur aahisatagi ke sath qirat kar rahe they aur awaz ko halaq mein dohraatey they."
"5048","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey abu-Moosa! tujhey Dawud (Alaihissalam) jaisi behtreen awaz ata ki gaee hai.''"
"5049","mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey Quran Majeed padh kar sunao. maine arz kya main aapko Quran sunaun aap par to Quran nazil hota hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main Quran Majeed doosrey se sunnaa mahboob rakhta hun."
"5050","mujh se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey Quran padh kar sunao. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! main aapko padh kar sunaun, aap par to Quran Majeed nazil hota hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya haan sunao. chunanche maine sura Nisa padhi jab main aayat فكيف إذا جئنا من كل أمة بشهيد وجئنا بك على هؤلاء شهيدا par pahuncha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab bas karo. maine aap ki taraf dekha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aankhon se aansu jari they."
"5051","Namaz mein kitna Quran padhna kafi ho sakta hai. phir maine dekha ke aik sura mein teen aayaton se kam nahi hai. isliye maine ye raey qaaim ki ke kisi ke liye teen aayaton se kam padhna munasib nahi. Ali al-Madeenii ne bayan kya ke ham se Sufiyan Sory ne bayan kya, kaha ham ko Mansoor ne khabar di, unhein Ibrahim ne, unhein Abdur-Rehman bin Yazeed ne, unhein Alqama ne khabar di aur unhein Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne (alqama ne bayan kya ke) maine unse mulaqat ki to wo Baitullah ka tawaaf kar rahe they. unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka zikr kya (ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha) ke jisne sura al-Baqara ke aakhiri ki 2 aayatein raat mein padh lin wo uske liye kafi hain."
"5052","mere walid Amr-bin-al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) ne mera nikah aik sharif khandan ki aurat (umme-Muhammad binte- mahmiya) se kar diya tha aur hamesha uski khabar-geerii kartey rahtey they aur unse baar-baar uske shauhar (yani khud un) ke mutaalliq poochhtey rahtey they. meri biwi kehti ke bahut achchha mard hai. albatta jab se main unke nikah mein aai hun unhon-ne ab tak hamarey bistar par qadam bhi nahi rakha na mere kapdey mein kabhi hath dala. jab bahut din isi tarah ho gaey to walid sahib ne majbur ho kar iska tazkira Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujh se uski mulaqat karaao. chunanche main iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mila. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke roza kis tarah rakhtey ho. maine arz kya ke rozaana. phir malum farmaya Quran Majeed kis tarah khatm kartey ho? maine arz kya har raat. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har mahiney mein teen din rozey rakho aur Quran aik mahiney mein khatm karo. bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! mujhey is se zyada ki taqat hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir bila rozey ke raho aur aik din rozey se. maine arz kya mujhey us se bhi zyada ki taqat hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir wo roza rakho jo sabse afzal hai, yani Dawud (Alaihissalam) ka roza , aik din roza rakho aur aik din iftaar karo aur Quran Majeed saat (7) din mein khatm karo. Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) kaha kartey they kash! maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki rukhsat qabool kar li hoti kyonke ab main boodha aur kamzor ho gaya hun. Hajjaj ne kaha ke aap apne ghar ke kisi aadmi ko Quran Majeed ka saatwan hissey yani aik manzil din mein suna detey they. jitna Quran Majeed aap raat ke waqt padhtey usey pahley din mein suna rakhtey taake raat ke waqt aasani se padh sakein aur jab ( quwwat khatm ho jati aur nidhaal ho jatey aur) quwwat hasil karna chahtey to kai-kai din roza na rakhtey kyonke aapko ye pasand nahi tha ke jis cheez ka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aagey wada kar liya hai (eik din roza rakhna aik din iftaar karna ( usmein se kuchh bhi chhodein. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) kehtey hain ke kuchh rawiyon ne teen din main aur kuchh ne panch din mein. lekin aksar ne saat (7) raaton mein khatm ki hadis riwayat ki hai."
"5053","mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke Quran Majeed tum kitney din mein khatm kar letey ho?"
"5054","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke har mahiney mein Quran ka aik hissey khatm kya karo maine arz kya mujh ko to zyada padhney ki taqat hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha saat (7) raaton mein khatm kya karo. us se zyada mat padh."
"5055","is hadis ka kuchh tukda Aamash ne Ibrahim se khud suna hai aur kuchh tukda Amr-bin-Murra sey, unhoney Ibrahim se suna hai ke mujh se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, (dusri sanad ( ham se Musaddad ne bayan kyaa, kaha ham se Yahya Qataan ney, un se Sufiyan saurii ney, un se Aamash ney, un se Ibrahim ney, un se Ubeda salmaanii ne aur un se Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ney. Aamash ne bayan kya ke maine is hadis ka aik tukda to khud Ibrahim se suna aur aik tukda is hadis ka mujh se Amr-bin-Murra ne naql kyaa, un se Ibrahim ney, un se unke walid ne un se abu-Zuha ne aur un se Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya mere samney Quran Majeed ki tilawat karo. maine arz kya aanhazrat ke samney main kya tilawat karun aap par too Quran Majeed nazil hi hota hai. huzoor akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main chahta hun ke kisi aur se sunoon. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir maine sura Nisa padhi aur jab main aayat «فَكَيْفَ إِذَا جِئْنَا مِنْ كُلِّ أُمَّةٍ بِشَهِيدٍ، وَجِئْنَا بِكَ عَلَى هَؤُلاَءِ شَهِيدًا» par pahuncha to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke thahar jao (aanhazrat (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( «کف» farmaya ya «امسک» rawi ko shak hai. maine dekha ke aanhazrat (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aankhon se aansu bah rahey they."
"5056","mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey Quran Majeed padh kar sunao. maine arz kya : kya main sunaun? aap par to Quran Majeed nazil hota hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main kisi se sunnaa mahboob rakhta hun."
"5057","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aakhiri zamane mein aik qaum paida hogi naujawaanon aur kam aqlon ki. ye log aisa behtreen kalam padhengey jo behtreen khalq ka (paighambar ka ( hai ya aisa kalam padhengey jo sarey khalq ke kalaamon se afzal hai. (yani hadis ya aayat padhengey us se sanad laaengey) lekin Islam se wo is tarah nikal jaeinge jaisey teer shikar ko paar karke nikal jata hai unka eman unke halaq se nichey nahi utrega tum unhein jahan bhi paogey qatl kar do. kyonke unka qatl qiyamat mein us shakhs ke liye baaise-ajr hoga jo unhein qatl kar dega."
"5058","tum mein aik qaum aisi paida hogi ke tum apni Namaz ko unki Namaz ke muqable mein haqeer samjhogey, unke rozon ke muqable main tumhen apne rozey aur unke amal ke muqaabla main tumhen apna amal haqeer nazar aayega aur wo Quran Majeed ki tilawat bhi karengey lekin Quran Majeed unke halaq se nichey nahi utrega . Deen se wo is tarah nikal jaeinge jaisey teer shikar ko paar kartey huey nikal jata hai aur wo bhi itni safaaii ke sath (ke teer chalaney wala ( teer ke phal mein dekhta hai to usmein bhi) shikar ke khoon wghaira ka ( koi asar nazar nahi aataa. us se uper dekhta hai wahan bhi kuchh nazar nahi aataa. teer ke par ko dekhta hai aur wahan bhi kuchh nazar nahi aataa. bas usey fal mein kuchh shuba guzarta hai."
"5059","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us momin ki misal jo Quran Majeed padhta hai aur is par amal bhi karta hai methey leemoon ki si hai jiska mazaa bhi lazzat daar aur khushbu bhi achi aur wo momin jo Quran padhta to nahi lekin is par amal karta hai uski misal khajoor ki hai jiska maza to umda hai lekin khushbu ke baghair aur us munafiq ki misal jo Quran padhta hai reaihaan ki si hai jiski khushbu to achi hoti hai lekin mazaa kadwaa hota hai aur us munafiq ki misal jo Quran bhi nahi padhta indraayan ke phal ki si hai jiska maza bhi kadwaa hota hai) rawi ko shak hai) ke lafz ( mar ( hai ya ( khabees (aur uski bo bhi kharaab hoti hai."
"5060","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Quran Majeed us waqt tak padho jab tak usmein dil lagey, jab ji uchaat honey lagey to padhna band kar do."
"5061","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is Quran ko jab hi tak padho jab tak tumharey dil miley juley ya lagey rahen. jab ikhtilaf aur jhagdaa karne lago to uth khadey ho. ( Quran Majeed padhna moquf kar do ( salam ke sath us hadis ko Haris bin Ubaid aur Saeed bin Zaid ne bhi abu-Imran Jawni se riwayat kya aur Hammaad-bin-Salma aur Aban ne usko marfooan nahi balke mauqoofan riwayat kya hai aur ghandar Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne bhi Shoba se, unhon-ne abu-Imran se yun riwayat kya ke maine Jundub se suna, wo kehtey they. ( lekin mauqoofan riwayat kya) aur Abdullah-bin Aun ne usko abu-Imran se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin Samit se, unhon-ne umr (Raziallahu anhu) se unka qaul riwayat kya (marfooan nahi kya (aur Jundub ki riwayat zyada sahi hai."
"5062","Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik sahib (Uabii-bin-Ka'b (Raziallahu anhu)) ko aik aayat padhtey suna, wahi aayat unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske khilaf suni thi. (ibn-Mas'ood (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke) phir maine unka hath pakda aur unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum donon sahi ho (is liye apne apney taur par padho) (Shoba kehtey hain ke) mera ghalib guman ye hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya ke) ikhtilaf w nazaa' na kya karo) kyonke tum se pahley ki ummaton ne ikhtilaf kya aur usi wjah se Allah Taala ne unhein halaak kar diya."
"5063","teen hazraat ( Ali-bin abi-Talib , Abdullah-bin Amr-bin-al-Aas aur Usman bin Mazoon (Raziallahu anhu)) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak beeviyon ke gharon ki taraf aap ki ibadat ke mutaalliq poochhney aaey, jab unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka amal bataya gaya to jaisey unhon-ne usey kam samjha aur kaha ke hamara Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya muqaabla ! aap ki to tamam agli pichhli khataein maaf kar di gaee hain. unmein se aik ne kaha ke aaj se main hamesha raat bhar Namaz padha karunga. doosrey ne kaha ke main hamesha rozey se rahunga aur kabhi naagha nahi honey doonga. teesrey ne kaha ke main aurton se judai ikhtiyar kar loonga aur kabhi nikah nahi karunga. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur unse puchha kya tum ne hi ye baatein kahi hain? sun lo! Allah Taala ki qasam! Allah rabbul-aalameen se main tum sabse zyada darney wala hun. main tum mein sabse zyada parhezgaar hun lekin main agar rozey rakhta hun to iftaar bhi karta hun. Namaz padhta hon (raat mein) aur sota bhi hon aur main aurton se nikah karta hoon. فمن رغب an (an) سنتي فليس مني mere tareeqey se jisne be-raghbatii ki wo mujh mein se nahi hai."
"5064","aur unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se Allah Taala ke us irshaad وإن خفتم أن لا تقسطوا في اليتامى فانكحوا ما طاب لكم من Nisa مثنى وثلاث ورباع فإن خفتم أن لا تعدلوا فواحدة أو ما ملكت أيمانكم ذلك أدنى أن لا تعولواke mutaalliq puchha ''aur agar tumhen andesha ho ke tum yatimon se insaf na kar sakogey to jo auratein tumhen pasand hon unse nikah kar lo. 2-2 se, chahe teen-teen se, chahe chaar-chaar se, lekin agar tumhen andesha ho ke tum insaf nahi kar sakogey to phir aik hi par bas karo ya jo londi tumhari milk mein ho, is sura mein qawii ummeed hai ke tum zulm w zyadti na kar sakogey.'' Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : bhaanjey! aayat mein aisi yateem maaldaar ladki ka zikr hai jo apne wali ki parwarish mein ho. wo ladki ke maal aur uske husn ki wjah se uski taraf maail ho aur us se maamooli mehar par shadi karna chahta ho to aisey shakhs ko is aayat mein aisi ladki se nikah karne se mana kya gaya hai. haan agar iske sath insaf kar sakta ho aur pura mehar ada karne ka irada rakhta ho to ijazat hai, warna aisey logon se kaha gaya hai ke apni parwarish mein yateem ladkiyon ke siwa aur dusri ladkiyon se shadi kar lein."
"5065","mein Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath tha, unse Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ne Mina mein mulaqat ki aur kaha : aey abu-Abdur-Rehmaan! mujhey aap se aik kaam hai phir wo donon tanhai mein chaley gaey. Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha aey abu-Abdur-Rehman ! kya aap manzoor karengey ke ham aap ka nikah kisi kunwari ladki se kar dein jo aapko guzrey huey dinon yad dila de. chunkey Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) uski zarurat mehsus nahi kartey they isliye unhon-ne mujhey ishara kya aur kaha : alqama! main jab unki khidmat mein pahuncha to wo keh rahe they ke agar aap ka ye mashwara hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya tha aey naujawaano! tum mein jo bhi shadi ki taqat rakhta ho usey nikah kar lena chahiye kyonke ye khaahishe-nafsaanii ko tod dega."
"5066","main Alqama aur Aswad ( (Rahmatullahi-alaih) (ke sath Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, unhon-ne ham se kaha ke ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein naujawaan they aur hamein koi cheez muyassar nahi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya ke naujawaanon ki jamat ! tum mein jisey bhi nikah karne ke liye maalii taqat ho usey nikah kar lena chahiye kyonke ye nazar ko neechi rakhney wala aur sharmgah ki hifazat karne wala amal hai aur jo koi nikah ki ghurbat ki wajah se taqat na rakhta ho usey chahiye ke roza rakhey kyonke roza uski khuwaahishaat nafsaanii ko tod dega."
"5067","ham Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Ummul-Momenin Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ke janaaze mein Sharik they. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi hain jab tum unka janaaza uthao to zor-zor se harkat na dena balke ahista-ahista narmii ke sath janaaza ko lekar chalnaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aap ki wafat ke waqt aap ke nikah mein nau (9) beeviyan thin aath (8) ke liye to aap ne baari muqarrar kar rakhi thi lekin aik ki baari nahi thi."
"5068","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik martaba aik hi raat main apni tamam beeviyon ke paas gaey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas nau (9) beeviyan thin. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke mujh se khaleefa ibne- khayyaat ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Saeed ne bayan kya, unse Qatada ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se phir yahi hadis bayan ki."
"5069","tum ne shadi kar li hai? maine arz kya ke nahi. aap (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke shadi kar lo kyonke is ummat ke behtreen shakhs jo they (yani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) unki bahut si beeviyan thin. kuch ne yun tarjama kya hai ke is ummat mein achchhey wahi log hain jinki bahut auratein hun."
"5070","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke amal ka daro-madar niyat par hai aur har shakhs ko wahi milta hai jiski wo niyat kare. isliye jiski hijrat Allah aur uske rasool ki raza hasil karne ke liye ho, usey Allah aur uske rasool ki raza hasil hogi lekin jiski hijrat duniya hasil karne ki niyat se ya kisi aurat se shadi karne ke irade se ho, uski hijrat usi ke liye hai jiske liye us ne hijrat ki."
"5071","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jihad kya kartey they aur hamarey sath beeviyan nahi thin. isliye ham ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! ham apne aapko khassi kyon na kar lein? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein us se mana farmaya,"
"5072","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu)) hijrat karke Madeena) aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke aur Sad-bin-Rabee Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ke darmyan bhai chaara karaya. Sad Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ke nikah mein 2 beeviyan thin. unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke wo unke ahal ( biwi (aur maal mein se aadha ley lein. is par Abdur-Rehman ne kaha ke Allah Taala aap ke ahal aur aap ke maal mein barkat de, mujhey to bazar ka rasta bata do. chunanche aap bazar aaey aur yahan aap ne kuchh paneer aur kuchh ghi ki tijarat ki aur nafa kamaayaa . chand dinon ke baad un par zafran ki zardi lagi hui thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke Abdur-Rehman ye kya hai? unhon-ne arz kya ke maine aik Ansari khatun se shadi kar li hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke unhein mehar mein kya diya arz kya ke aik guthli barabar sona diya hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir walima kar agarche aik bakri hi ka ho."
"5073","maine Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( تبتل ( yani aurton se alag rehney ki zindagi se mana farmaya tha. agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein ijazat de detey to ham to khassi hi ho jatey."
"5074","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Usman bin Mazoon (Raziallahu anhu) ko aurat se alag rehney ki ijazat nahi di thi. agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein uski ijazat de detey to ham bhi apne aapko khassi bana letey."
"5075","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jihad ko jaya kartey they aur hamarey paas rupya na tha (ke ham shadi kar letey) isliye ham ne arz kya ham apne ko khassi kyon na kara lein lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein us se mana farmaya, phir hamein uski ijazat de di ke ham kisi aurat se aik kapdey par (eik muddat tak ke liye) nikah kar lein. aap ne hamein Quran Majeed ki ye aayat padh kar sunaaii يا أيها الذين آمنوا لا تحرموا طيبات ما أحل الله لكم wla تعتدوا إن الله لا يحب المعتدين‏ ke ''emaan laney waalo! wo pakeeza cheezein mat haram karo jo tumharey liye Allah Taala ne halal ki hain aur had se aagey na badho, beshak Allah had se aagey badhney walon ko pasand nahi kartaa.''"
"5076","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! main naujawaan hun aur mujhey apne par zina ka khof rehta hai. mere paas koi aisi cheez nahi jis par main kisi aurat se shadi kar loon. aap meri ye baat sun kar khamosh rahe. dobara maine apni yahi baat dohraaii lekin aap us martaba bhi khamosh rahe. teesri baar maine arz kya aap phir bhi khamosh rahe. maine chothi martaba arz kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aey abu-Huraira! jo kuchh tum karogey usey (Lauhe-mahfooz mein) likh kar qalam khushk ho chuka hai. chahe ab tum khassi ho jao ya baaz raho. yani khassi hona bekaar mahz hai."
"5077","maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! farmaiye agar aap kisi wadi mein utrein aur is mein aik darakht aisa ho jis mein oont char gaey hon aur aik darakht aisa ho jis mein se kuchh bhi na khaya gaya ho to aap apna oont un darakhton mein se kis darakht mein charaaeingey? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us darakht mein jis mein se abhi charaayaa nahi gaya ho. unka ishara is taraf tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke siwa kisi kunwari ladki se nikah nahi kya."
"5078","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Aaisha! mujhey khuwab mein 2 martaba tum dikhai gaiin. aik shakhs ( Jibraeel ( tumhari sura hareer ke aik tukdey mein uthaey huey hai aur kehta hai ke ye aap ki biwi hai maine jo us kapdey ko khola to usmein tum thin. maine khayal kya ke agar ye khuwab Allah ki taraf se hai to wo usey zaroor pura karke rahega."
"5079","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik jihad se wapas ho rahe they. main apne oont ko, jo sust tha tez chalaney ki koshish kar raha tha. itney mein mere peechhey se aik sawar mujh se aa kar mila aur apna neza mere oont ko chubho diya. iski wjah se mera oont tez chal padaa jaisa ke kisi umda qism ke oont ki chaal tum ne dekhi hogi. achcha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mil gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya jaldi kyon kar rahe ho? maine arz kya abhi meri shadi nai hui hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kunwari se ya bewa se ? maine arz kya ke bewa se. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke kisi kunwari se kyon na ki tum uske sath khel kood kartey aur wo tumharey sath karti. bayan kya ke phir jab ham Madina mein dakhil hone-waale they, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke thodi der thahar jao aur raat ho jaey tab dakhil ho taake pareshan baalon wali kangha kar ley aur jinke shauhar maujood nahi they wo apne baal saaf kar lein."
"5080","maine shadi ki to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se malum farmaya ke kis se shadi ki hai? maine arz kya ke aik aurat se. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kunwari se kyon na ki ke iske sath tum khel-kood kartey. Maharib ne kaha ke phir maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye irshad Amr-bin-Dinar se bayan kya to unhon-ne kaha ke maine Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna hai. mujh se unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka farman is tarah bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke tum ne kisi kunwari aurat se shadi kyon na ki ke tum uske sath khel kood kartey aur wo tumharey sath kheltii."
"5081","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se shadi ke liye Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke main aap ka bhai hun. (to Aaisha se kaisey nikah karengey) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke Deen aur uski kitab par eman laney ke rishta se tum mere bhai ho aur Aaisha mere liye halal hai."
"5082","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke oont par Sawar honey wali) arab) aurton mein behtreen aurat Quraish ki Saleh aurat hoti hai jo apne bachchey se bahut zyada mohabbat karne wali aur apne shauhar ke maal asbaab mein uski bahut umda nigahbaan w nigraan Sabit hoti hai."
"5083","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis shakhs ke paas londi ho wo usey taleem de aur khub achi tarah de, usey adab sikhaaey aur poori koshish aur mehnat ke sath sikhaaey aur uske baad usey aazad karke us se shadi kar ley to usey dohra sawab milta hai aur ahle-kitab mein se jo shakhs bhi apne Nabi par eman rakhta ho aur mujh par eman laey to usey dohra sawab milta hai aur jo ghulam apne aaqa ke huquq bhi ada karta hai aur apne rab ke huquq bhi ada karta hai usey dohra sawab milta hai. Aamir Shabi ne (apne shagird se us hadis ko sunaney ke baad kaha ke baghair kisi mashaqqat aur mehnat ke usey seekh lo. us se pahley taalib ilmon ko us hadis se kam ke liye bhi Madina tak ka safar karna padta tha aur Abu-Bakar ne bayan kya abu-Haseen se, us ne abu-Barda se, us ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ke us shakhs ne baandi ko (nikaah karne ke liye) aazad kar diya aur yahi aazadi iska mehar muqarrar ki."
"5084","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, (doosri sanad) ham se Sulaimaan-bin-Harab ne bayan kya, unse Hammad-bin-Zaid ne, unse Ayub sakhtiyan ne, unse Muhammad-bin Sirin ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke Ibrahim ki zaban se teen martaba ke siwa kabhi Deen mein jhoot baat nahi niklii. aik martaba aap aik zaalim badshah ki hukumat se guzrey aap ke sath aap ki biwi saara (Alaihissalam) thin. phir pura waqia bayan kya (ke badshah ke saamney) aap ne saara (Alaihissalam) ko apni behan (yani deenii bahan) kaha, phir us badshah ne Saara (Alaihissalam) ko Aajar (Haajira) ko de diya. (bii-bii Saara (Alaihissalam) ne Ibrahim se) kaha ke Allah Taala ne kaafir ke hath ko rok diya aur Aajar ( Hajra ( ko meri khidmat ke liye dilwaa diya. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke aey aasman ke pani ke beto! yani aey Arab waalo! yahi Hajra (Alaihissalam) tumhari maan hain."
"5085","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaibar aur Madina ke darmyan teen din tak qiyam kya aur yahin Ummul-Momenin Safiya-binte-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath khilwat ki. phir maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke walima ki musalmanon ko dawat di. is da'wate-waleema mein na to roti thi aur na gosht tha. dastar-khuwaan bichhaaney ka hukm hua aur is par khajoor, paneer aur ghi rakh diya gaya aur yahi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka walima tha. kuchh musalmanon ne puchha ke Safiya ummahaatul momeneen (nabi ki beeviyon) mein se hain (yani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse nikah kya hai) ya londi ki haisiyat se aap ne unke sath khilwat ki hai? is par kuchh logon ne kaha ke agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke liye parde ka intizam farmaein to us se Sabit hoga ke wo ummahaatul momeneen (nabi ki beeviyon) mein se hain aur agar unke liye parde ka ehtimaam na karein to us se Sabit hoga ke wo londi ki haisiyat se aap ke sath hain. phir jab kooch karne ka waqt hua to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye apni sawari par baithney ke liye jagah banai aur unke liye parda daala taake logon ko wo nazar na aaein."
"5086","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ko aazad kya aur unki aazadi ko unka mehar qarar diya."
"5087","aik aurat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aai aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! main aap ki khidmat mein apne-aapko aap ke liye waqf karne hazir hui hun. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nazar utha kar usey dekha. phir aap ne nazar ko neechi kar liya aur phir apna sar jhukaa liya. jab us aurat ne dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke mutaalliq koi faisla nahi farmaya to wo baith gaee. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aik sahabi khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! agar aapko unse nikah ki zarurat nahi hai to unse mera nikah kar dijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumharey paas ( mehar ke liye) koi cheez hai? unhon-ne arz kya ke nahi, Allah ki qism , ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke apne ghar jao aur dekho mumkin hai tumhen koi cheez mil jaey. wo gaey aur wapas aagey aur arz kya : Allah ki qism ! maine kuchh nahi paya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar lohey ki aik anguthi bhi mil jaey to ley aao . wo gaey aur wapas aagey aur arz kya : Allah ki qasam, ya Rasulullah! mere paas lohey ki aik anguthi bhi nahi albatta mere paas aik tahmad hai. unhiin (khaatoon ko) usmein se aadha de dijiye. Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke unke paas chadar bhi nahi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye tumharey us tahmad ka kya karegii. agar tum usey pahnogey to unke liye usmein se kuchh nahi bachega aur agar wo pahan ley to tumharey liye kuchh nahi rahega. iske baad wo sahabi baith gaey. kafi der tak baithey rehney ke baad jab wo khadey huey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha ke wo wapas ja rahe hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bulwaya jab wo aaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumhen Quran Majeed kitna yad hai? unhon-ne arz kya ke falan-falan soortein yad hain. unhon-ne gin kar bataein . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya tum inhein baghair dekhey padh saktey ho? unhon-ne arz kya ke ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir jao . maine unhein tumharey nikah mein diya. un Suraton ke badley jo tumhen yad hain."
"5088","abu-Huzaifa bin Utba-bin- Rabee bin Abd-Shams ( مہشم ( ne jawan sahaba mein se they jinhoney Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jange-badr mein shirkat ki thi. Saalim-bin Maaqil (Raziallahu anhu) ko ley-paalak betaa banaya, aur phir unka nikah apne bhai ki ladki Hinda-binte-Waleed-bin-Utba-bin- Rabee se kar diya. pahley Salim (Raziallahu anhu) aik Ansari khatun ke aazad karda ghulam they lekin Huzefa ne unko apna munh bola betaa banaya tha jaisa ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zaid ko (jo aap hi ke aazad karda ghulam they) apna ley-paalak betaa banaya tha jahiliyat ke zamaney mein ye dastoor tha ke agar koi shakhs kisi ko ley-paalak betaa bana leta to log usey usi ki taraf nisbat karke pukara kartey they aur ley-paalak betaa uski meeraas mein se bhi hissey paata aakhir jab sura Hujuraat mein ye aayat utri ( ادعوهم لآبائهم‏ (ke '' unhein unke haqiqi baapon ki taraf mansub karke pukaaro ''Allah taala ke farman ( ومواليكم‏ ( tak to log unhein unke baapon ki taraf mansub karke pukarney lagey jiske bap ka ilm na hota to usey ( مولى (aur deenii bhai kaha jata. phir Sehla binte- Suhail-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) jo abu-Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi hain Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham to Salim ko apna haqiqi jaisa betaa samajhtey they ab Allah ne jo hukm utara wo aapko malum hai phir aakhir tak hadis bayan ki."
"5089","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zabaa binte- Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey (ye Zuber abdul-Muttalib ke betey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chacha they) aur unse farmaya shayad tumhara irada Haj ka hai? unhon-ne arz kya : Allah ki qasam! main to apne aapko bimar paatii hun Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke phir bhi Haj ka ehram baandh ley. albatta shart laga lena aur ye keh lena ke aey Allah ! main us waqt halal ho jaaungii jab to mujhey (marz ki wjah se) rok lega aur (zaba'a binte- Zuber qureshi (Raziallahu anhu)) Miqdaad-bin-Aswad (Raziallahu anhu) ke nikah mein thin."
"5090","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aurat se nikah char chizon ki buniyad par kya jata hai uske maal ki wjah se aur uske khaandaanii sharf ki wjah se aur uski khoobsoortii ki wjah se aur uske Deen ki wjah se aur to diindaar aurat se nikah karke kamiyabi hasil kar, agar aisa na karey to terey hathon ko mitti lagegii (yani akheer mein tujh ko nadaamat hogi) ."
"5091","aik sahib (jo maaldaar they) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney se guzrey . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne paas maujood sahaba se puchha ke ye kaisa shakhs hai? sahaba ne arz kya ke ye us laaiq hai ke agar ye nikah ka paigham bhejey to us se nikah kya jaey, agar kisi ki sifarish karey to uski sifarish qabool ki jaey, agar koi baat kahey to ghaur se suni jaey. Sehal ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par chup ho rahe. phir aik doosrey sahib guzrey, jo musalmanon ke ghareeb aur mohtaaj logon mein shumaar kiye jatey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke iske mutaalliq tumhara kya khayal hai? sahaba ne arz kya ke ye is qaabil hai ke agar kisi ke yahan nikah ka paigham bhejey to us se nikah na kya jaey agar kisi ki sifarish karey to uski sifarish qabool na ki jaey, agar koi baat kahey to uski baat na suni jaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke ye shakhs akelaa pahley shakhs ki tarah duniya bhar se behtar hai."
"5092","unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se aayat (وإن خفتم أن لا تقسطوا في اليتامى‏) ''aur agar tumhen khof ho ke yateem ladkiyon ke barey main tum insaf nahi kar sakogey.'' ke mutaalliq sawal kya. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha mere bhaanjey! is aayat mein us yateem ladki ka hukm bayan hua hai jo apne wali ki parwarish mein ho aur uska wali uski khoobsoortii aur maaldaaii par reejh kar ye chahey ke us se nikah karey lekin uske mehar mein kami karne ka bhi irada ho. aisey wali ko apni zer parwarish yateem ladki se nikah karne se mana kya gaya hai jab wo unka mehar insaf se pura ada karengey agar wo aisa na karein to phir aayat mein aisey waliyon ko hukm diya gaya ke wo apni zere-parwarish yateem ladki ke siwa kisi aur se nikah kar lein. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uske baad sawal kya to Allah Taala ne sura Nisa mein aayat ( ويستفتونك في Nisa ( se ( وترغبون أن تنكحوهن‏ ( tak nazil ki. is aayat mein Allah Taala ne ye hukm diya ke yateem ladkiyan agar khoobsurat aur saahibe-maal hon to unke wali bhi unke sath nikah kar lena chahtey hain, uska khandan pasand kartey hain aur mehar pura ada karke unse nikah kar letey hain. lekin unmein husn ki kami ho aur maal bhi na ho to phir unki taraf raghbat nahi hogi aur wo unhein chhod kar dusri aurton se nikah kar letey hain. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke aayat ka matlab ye hai ke jaisey us waqt yateem ladki ko chhod detey hain jab wo naadaar ho aur khoobsurat na ho aisey hi us waqt bhi chhod dena chahiye jab wo maaldaar aur khoobsurat ho albatta agar uske haq mein insaf karein aur uska mehar pura ada karein tab us se nikah kar saktey hain."
"5093","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahoosat aurat mein, ghar main aur ghodey mein ho sakti hai) nahoosat be-barkatii agar ho to unmein ho sakti hai)."
"5094","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney nahoosat ka zikr kya gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar nahoosat kisi cheez mein ho to ghar, aurat aur ghodey mein ho sakti hai."
"5095","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar ( nahoosat ( kisi cheez mein ho to ghodey, aurat aur ghar mein ho sakti hai."
"5096","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine apne baad mardon ke liye aurton ke fitne se badh kar nuqsan dene wala aur koi fitna nahi chhoda hai."
"5097","Barira ke sath teen sunnat qaaim hoti hain, unhein aazad kya aur phir ikhtiyar diya gaya (ke agar chaahein to apne pichhley shauhar se apna nikah tod sakti hain) aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (Bareera (Raziallahu anhu) ke barey mein) farmaya ke 'walaa' aazad karaaney waley ke sath qaaim hui hai aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghar mein dakhil huey to aik handi (gosht ki) choolhey par thi. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye roti aur ghar ka saalan laya gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) choolhey par) handi ( gosht ki) bhi to maine dekhi thi. arz kya gaya ke wo handi us gosht ki thi jo Barira ko sadqe mein mila tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sadqa nahi khaatey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo uske liye sadqa hai aur ab hamarey liye unki taraf se tohfa hai. ham usey kha saktey hain."
"5098","Allah Taala ke irshaad (وإن خفتم أن لا ، Mina تقسطوا في اليتامى) ''aur agar tumhen khof ho ke tum yatimon ke barey mein insaf nahi kar sakogey.'' ke barey mein farmaya ke us se murad yateem ladki hai jo apne wali ki parwarish mein ho. wali us se iske maal ki wjah se shadi kartey aur achi tarah us se sulook na kartey aur na iske maal ke barey mein insaf kartey aisey shakhson ko ye hukm hua ke us yateem ladki se nikah na karein balke iske siwa jo auratein bhalii lagein unse nikah kar lein. 2-2, teen-teen ya chaar-chaar tak ki ijazat hai."
"5099","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke yahan tashrif rakhtey they aur aap ne suna ke koi sahib Ummul-Momenin Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar mein andar aaney ki ijazat chahtey hain. bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye shakhs aap ke ghar mein aaney ki ijazat chahta hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mera khayal hai ke ye falan shakhs hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke aik doodh ke chacha ka naam liya. is par Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne puchha : kya fulaan, jo unke dudh-sharik chacha they, agar zinda hotey to mere yahan aa ja saktey they? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, jaisey khoon milney se hurmat hoti hai, waisey hi doodh peeney se bhi hurmat Sabit ho jati hai."
"5100","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya ke aap Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) ki beti se nikah kyon nahi kar letey? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo mere dudh-sharik bhai ki beti hai. aur Bishr-bin-Umar ne bayan kya, unse Shoba ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Qatada se suna aur unhon-ne isi tarah Jaabir bin Zaid se suna."
"5101","unhon-ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! meri behan ( Abu-Sufiyan ki ladki ( se nikah kar lijiye . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum usey pasand karogii (ke tumhari saukan behan baney)? maine arz kya ji haan, main to pasand karti hun agar main akelii aap ki biwi hoti to pasand na karti . phir meri behan agar mere sath bhalai mein Sharik ho to main kyonkar na chaahoongii (ghairon se to behan hi achi hai) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya wo mere liye halal nahi hai. Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah! log kehtey hain aap abu-Salma ki beti se jo Umme-Salma ke pet se hai, nikah karne waley hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar wo meri rubaiba aur meri parwarish mein na hoti (yani meri biwi ki beti na hotii) jab bhi mere liye halal na hoti. wo doosrey rishtey se meri dudh-sharik bhateejii hai, mujh ko aur abu-Salma ke bap ko donon ko Saubiya ne doodh pilaya hai. dekho, aisa mat karo apni betiyon aur bahnon ko mujh se nikah karne ke liye na kaho. Urwa rawi ne kaha soobiya abu-Lahab ki londi thi. abu-Lahab ne usko aazad kar diya tha. (jab us ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paida honey ki khabar abu-Lahab ko di thi) phir us ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko doodh pilaya tha jab abu-Lahab mar gaya to uske kisi azeez ne marney ke baad usko khuwab mein burey haal mein dekha to puchha kya haal hai kya guzrii? wo kehney laga jab se main tum se juda hua hun kabhi aaraam nahi mila magar aik zara sa pani (peer ke din mil jata hai) abu-Lahab ne us gadhey ki taraf ishara kya jo angoothey aur kalima ke ungli ke beech mein hota hai ye bhi us wjah se ke maine soobiya ko aazad kar diya tha."
"5102","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas tashrif laey to dekha ke unke yahan aik mard betha hua hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehrey ka rang badal gaya maano ke aap ne usko pasand nahi farmaya Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne arz kya ya Rasulullah! ye mere dudh-sharik bhai hain Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya dekho, soch-samajh kar kaho kon tumhara bhai hai."
"5103","abu-Qaees ke bhai Aflah ne unke yahan andar aaney ki ijazat chahi . wo Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke dudh-sharik chacha they (ye waqia parde ka hukm nazil honey ke baad ka hai Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke) maine unhein andar aaney ki ijazat nahi di phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unke sath apne mamley ko bataya, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey hukm diya ke main unhein andar aaney ki ijazat de dun."
"5104","maine ye hadis khud Aqba se bhi suni hai lekin mujhey Ubaid ke waastey se suni hui hadis zyada yad hai. Aqba bin-Haaris ne bayan kya ke maine aik aurat (umme-Yahyaa bin abi ahaab) se nikah kya. phir aik kali aurat aai aur kehney lagi ke maine tum donon (miyaan beewii) ko doodh pilaya hai. main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya ke maine fulaanii binte- falan se nikah kya hai. iske baad hamarey yahan aik kali aurat aai aur mujh se kehney lagi ke maine tum donon ko doodh pilaya hai, halanke wo jhooti hai (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Aqba ka ye kehna ke wo jhooti hai na-gawar guzra (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par apna chehra Mubarak pher liya. phir main aap ke samney aaya aur arz kya wo aurat jhooti hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us biwi se ab kaisey nikah reh sakega jabke ye aurat yun kehti hai ke usne tum donon ko doodh pilaya hai, us aurat ko apne se alag kar do. '' ( hadis ke rawi ( Ismail bin-Ulaih ne apni shahadat aur beech ki ungli se ishara karke bataya ke Ayub ne is tarah ishara karke ."
"5105","khoon ki ro se tum par saat (7) rishtey haram hain aur shadi ki wjah se (yani sasuraal ki taraf se) saat (7) rishtey bhii. unhon-ne ye aayat padhii حرمت عليكم أمهاتكم aakhir tak aur Abdullah-bin Jafar bin abii-Taalib ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki sahibzadi Zenab aur Ali ki bii-bii (Laila-binte-Mas'ood ( donon se nikah kya, unko jama kya aur Ibne-Sirin ne kaha usmein koi qabahat nahi hai aur imam Hasan Basri ne aik baar to usey makruh kaha phir kehney lagey usmein koi qabahat nahi hai aur Hasan-bin- Hasan-bin-Ali bin abii-Taalib ne apne donon chaachaaon (yani Muhammad-bin Ali aur Amr bin Ali ( ki betiyon ko aik sath mein nikah mein ley liya aur Jaabir bin Zaid Taabai ne usko makruh jaana, is khayal se ke bahnon mein jalaapaa na paida ho magar ye kuchh haram nahi hai kyonke Allah Taala ne farmaya ( وأحل لكم ما وراء ذلكم‏ (ke unke siwa aur sab auratein tum ko halal hain. aur Ikrima ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kya ke agar kisi ne apni saalii se zina kya to uski biwi ( saalii ki bahan) is par haram na hogi aur Yahyaa-bin-Qais Kandi se riwayat hai, unhon-ne Shabi aur Jafar se, donon ne kaha agar koi shakhs lawaatat karey aur kisi laundey ke dakhil kar de to ab uski maan se nikah na kare. aur Yahya rawi mashhoor shakhs nahi hai aur na kisi aur ne uske sath ho kar ye riwayat ki hai aur Ikrima ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke agar kisi ne apni saas se zina kya to uski biwi is par haram na hogi aur abu-Nasar ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke haram ho jaeygi aur us rawi abu-nasa ka haal malum nahi. us ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna hai ya nahi (lekin Abu-Zaraa ne usey qaabile-bharosa kaha hai) aur Imran-bin-Husain aur Jaabir bin Zaid aur Hasan Basri aur kuchh Iraq walon (Imam Sory aur imam abu-Haneefa (rh)) ka yahi qaul hai ke haram ho jaeygi aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha haram na hogi jab tak uski maan (apni khush-daaman) ko zameen se na laga de (yani us se hambistari na karey) aur Saeed-bin-Musaiyab aur Urwa aur Zohri ne uske mutaalliq kaha hai ke agar koi saas se zina karey tab bhi uski beti yani zina karne waley ki biwi is par haram na hogi (usko rakh sakta hai) aur Zohri ne kaha Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke uski joru is par haram na hogi aur ye riwayat munqata' hai."
"5106","maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! aap Abu-Sufiyan ki sahibzadi (Gharra ya darra ya hamna) ko chahtey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir main iske sath kya karunga ? maine arz kya ke us se aap nikah kar lein. farmaya kya tum usey pasand karogii? maine arz kya main koi tanha to hun nahi aur main apni behan ke liye ye pasand karti hun ke wo bhi mere sath aap ke talluq mein Sharik ho jaey. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo mere liye halal nahi hai. maine arz kya mujhey malum hua hai ke aap ne ( Zenab se) nikah ka paigham bheja hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Umme-Salma ki ladki ke paas? maine kaha ke ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke waah-waah, agar wo meri rubaiba na hoti jab bhi wo mere liye halal na hoti. mujhey aur uske walid abu-Salma ko Soobiya ne doodh pilaya tha. dekho tum aainda mere nikah ke liye apni ladkiyon aur bahnon ko na pesh kya karo aur Lais-bin-Sad ne bhi is hadis ko Hisham se riwayat kya hai is mein abu-Salma ki beti ka naam darra mazkoor hai."
"5107","Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! meri behan ( غرہ ( binte- abi Sufiyan se aap nikah kar lein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aur tumhen bhi pasand hai? maine arz kya ji haan koi main tanha to hun nahi aur meri khahish hai ke aap ki bhalai mein mere sath meri behan bhi Sharik ho jaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye mere liye halal nahi hai. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Allah ki qism ! is tarah ki baatein sunney mein aati hain ke aap abu-Salma ki sahibzadi darra se nikah karna chahtey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke Umme-Salma ki ladki se? maine kaha ji haan. farmaya Allah ki qism agar wo meri parwarish mein na hoti jab bhi wo mere liye halal nahi thi kyonke wo mere doodh Sharik bhai ki ladki hai. mujhey aur abu-Salma ko soobiya ne doodh pilaya tha. (is liye wo meri doodh Sharik bhateejii ho gai) tum log mere nikah ke liye apni ladkiyon aur bahnon ko na pesh kya karo."
"5108","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kisi aisi aurat se nikah karne se mana kya tha jiski phoophii ya khala uske nikah mein ho. aur Dawud bin Aun ne Shabi se bayan kya aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne."
"5109","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kisi aurat ko uski phoophii ya uski khala ke sath nikah mein jama na kya jaey."
"5110","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana kya hai ke kisi aurat ko uski phoophii ya uski khala ke sath nikah mein jama kya jaey (Zohri ne kaha ke) ham samajhtey hain ke aurat ke bap ki khala bhi (haraam honey mein) usi darje mein hai kyonke (aglii hadis dekhein)."
"5111","razaat se bhi un tamam rishton ko haram samjho jo khoon ki wjah se haram hotey hain."
"5112","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne shighaar se mana farmaya hai. shighaar ye hai ke koi shakhs apni ladki ya behan ka nikah is shart ke sath karey ke wo doosra shakhs apni (betii ya bahan) usko biyaah de aur kuchh mehar na thahrey."
"5113","Khaula binte- hakeem (Raziallahu anhu) un aurton mein se thin jinhoney apne aapko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye hiba kya tha. is par Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke aik aurat apne aapko kisi mard ke liye hiba kartey sharmaatii nahi. phir jab aayat ( ترجئ من تشاء منهن‏ ( ''aey paighambar ! to apni jis biwi ko chahey peechhey daal de aur jisey chahey apne paas jagah de '' nazil hui to maine kaha : ya Rasulullah ! ab main samjhii Allah Taala jaldi-jaldi aap ki khushi ko pura karta hai. is hadis ko abu-Saeed (Muhammad-bin muslim), muaddab aur Muhammad-bin-Bishr aur Abda bin Sulaiman ne bhi Hisham se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat kya hai. aik ne doosrey se kuchh zyada mazmoon naql kya hai."
"5114","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (Memoona (Raziallahu anhu) se) nikah kya aur us waqt aap ehram baandhey huey they."
"5115","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mutaa aur paaltu gadhey ke gosht se jang khaibar ke zamane mein mana farmaya tha."
"5116","unse aurton ke sath nikah mutaa karne ke mutaalliq sawal kya gaya tha to unhon-ne uski ijazat di, phir unke aik ghulam ne unse puchha ke uski ijazat sakht majboorii ya aurton ki kami ya usi jaisi Suraton mein hogii? to Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke haan. (note : ye hurmat se qabl ki baat hai baad mein har haalat mein har shakhs ke liye mutaa haram qarar diya gaya jo qiyamat tak ke liye hai)."
"5117","ham aik lashkar mein they. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif laey aur farmaya ke tumhen mutaa karne ki ijazat di gaee hai is liye tum nikah kar saktey ho."
"5118","ham aik lashkar mein they. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif laey aur farmaya ke tumhen mutaa karne ki ijazat di gaee hai is liye tum nikah kar saktey ho."
"5119","jo mard aur aurat mutaa kar lein aur koi muddat mutaiyan na karein to (kam se kam) teen din, teen raat mil kar rahein, phir agar wo teen din se zyada us mutaa ko rakhna chaahein ya khatm karna chaahein to unhein uski ijazat hai (Salma bin Akwa' kehtey hain ke) mujhey malum nahi ye hukm sirf hamarey ( sahaba ( hi ke liye tha ya tamam logon ke liye hai abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( kehtey hain ke khud Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aisi riwayat ki jis se malum hota hai ke mutaa ki hillat mansukh hai."
"5120","main Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas tha aur unke paas unki beti bhi thin. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke aik khatun Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apne aapko Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye pesh karne ki gharaz se hazir huin aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya aapko meri zarurat hai? is par Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki beti boliin ke wo kaisi be-haya aurat thi. haaye, be-sharmii! haaye be-sharmii! Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha wo tum se behtar thin, unko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf raghbat thi, isliye unhon-ne apne aapko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye pesh kya."
"5121","aik aurat ne apne aapko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se nikah ke liye pesh kya. phir aik sahabi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! unka nikah mujh se kara dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya tumharey paas ( mehar ke liye) kya hai? unhon-ne kaha ke mere paas to kuchh bhi nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jao aur talash karo, chahe lohey ki aik anguthi hi mil jaey. wo gaey aur wapas aagey aur arz kya ke Allah ki qism ! maine koi cheez nahi paai . mujhey lohey ki anguthi bhi nahi mili , albatta ye mera tahmad mere paas hai iska aadha unhein de dijiye. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke unke paas chadar bhi nahi thi. magar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye tumharey us tahmad ka kya karegii, agar ye usey pahan leygii to ye is qadr chhota kapda hai ke phir to tumharey liye usmein se kuchh baqi nahi bachchey ga aur agar tum pahno gey to uske liye kuchh nahi rahega. phir wo sahib baith gaey, der tak baithey rehney ke baad uthey (aur janey lagey) to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha aur bulaayaa, ya unhein bulaya gaya (raawii ko un alfaz mein shak tha) phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse puchha ke tumhen Quran kitna yad hai? unhon-ne kaha ke mujhey fulaan, falan soortein yad hain chand soortein unhon-ne ginaaiin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ham ne tumharey nikah mein usko us Quran ke badley de diya jo tumhen yad hai."
"5122","jab (unki saahibzaadii) Hafsa binte- umr (Raziallahu anhu) (apne shauhar) Khunais bin Huzafa Sehmi ki wafat ki wjah se bewa ho gain aur Khunais Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahabi they aur unki wafat Madina Munawra mein hui thi. umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke main Usman-bin-Affan (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur unke liye Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ko pesh kya. unhon-ne kaha ke main is maamle mein ghaur karunga. maine kuchh dinon tak intizar kya. phir mujh se Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne mulaqat ki aur maine kaha ke agar aap pasand karein to main aap ki shadi Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se kar dun Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) khamosh rahe aur mujhey koi jawab nahi diya. unki is berukhi se mujhey Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke maamle se bhi zyada ranj hua. kuchh dinon tak mein khamosh raha. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se nikah ka paigham bheja aur maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uski shadi kar di. uske baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) mujh se miley aur kaha ke jab tum ne Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ka mamla mere samney pesh kya tha to mere is par khamosh rehney se tumhen takleef hui hogi ke maine tumhen iska koi jawab nahi diya tha. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine kaha ke waqei hui thi Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tum ne jo kuchh mere samney rakha tha, iska jawab maine sirf is wjah se nahi diya tha ke mere ilm mein tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ka zikr kya hai aur main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke raaz ko zahir karna nahi chahta tha agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chhod detey to main Hafsa ko apne nikah mein ley aataa."
"5123","Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke hamein malum hua hai ke aap darra binte- abi Salma se nikah karne waley hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya main us se iske bawajud nikah kar sakta hun ke (unki maan ( Umme-Salma mere nikah mein pahley hi se maujood hai aur agar main Umme-Salma se nikah na kiye hota jab bhi wo darra mere liye halal nahi thi. kyonke iske walid ( abu-Salma (Raziallahu anhu)) mere doodh Sharik bhai they."
"5124","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aayat ( فيما عرضتم‏ ( ki tafseer mein kaha ke koi shakhs kisi aisi aurat se jo iddat mein ho kahey ke mera irada nikah ka hai aur meri khahish hai ke mujhey koi nek bakht aurat muyassar aa jaey aur us nikah mein Qasim-bin-Muhammad ne kaha ke (ta'reez ye hai ke) iddat mein aurat se kahey ke tum meri nazar mein bahut achi ho aur mera khayal nikah karne ka hai aur Allah tumhen bhalai pahunchaaeyga ya isi tarah ke jumley kahey aur Ataa-bin-Abii Ribah ne kaha ke ta'reez w kinaaya se kahey. saaf-saaf na kahey (maslan) kahey ke mujhey nikah ki zarurat hai aur tumhen bashaarat ho aur Allah ke Fazal se achi ho aur aurat iske jawab mein kahey ke tumhari baat maine sun li hai (b-saraahat) koi wada na karey aisi aurat ka wali bhi iske ilm ke baghair koi wada na karey aur agar aurat ne zamana iddat mein kisi mard se nikah ka wada kar liya aur phir baad mein us se nikah kya to donon mein judai nahi karaai jaeygi. Hasan ne kaha ke (لا تواعدوهن سرا) se ye murad hai ke aurat se chhup kar badkaarii na karo. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se manqul hai ke) الكتاب أجله‏ ( se murad iddat ka pura karna hai."
"5125","mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke (nikaah se pahley) maine tumhen khuwab mein dekha ke aik farishta (Jibraaiil (al)) resham ke aik tukdey main tumhen lapet kar ley aaya hai aur mujh se keh raha hai ke ye tumhari biwi hai. maine iske chehrey se kapda hataya to wo tum thin. maine kaha ke agar ye khuwab Allah ki taraf se hai to wo usey khud hi pura kar dega."
"5126","aik khatun Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! main aap ki khidmat main apne aapko hiba karne aai hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf dekha aur nazar utha kar dekha, phir nazar neechi kar li aur sar ko jhukaa liya. jab khatun ne dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke barey mein koi faisla nahi farmaya to baith gaiin. iske baad aap ke sahaba mein se aik sahib khadey huey aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! agar aapko unki zarurat nahi to unka nikah mujh se kara dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumharey paas koi cheez hai? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi ya rasoolullaah, Allah ki qasam! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne ghar jao aur dekho shayad koi cheez mil jaey. wo gaey aur wapas aa kar kaha ke nahi ya Rasulullah ! maine koi cheez nahi paai . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur dekh lo, agar aik lohey ki anguthi bhi mil jaey. wo gaey aur wapas aa kar arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mujhey lohey ki anguthi bhi nahi mili , albatta ye mera tahmad hai. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke unke paas chadar bhi nahi thi (un sahabi ne kaha ke) un khatun ko us tahmad mein se aadha inayat farma dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye tumharey tahmad ka kya karegi agar tum usey pahnogey to uske liye usmein se kuchh baqi nahi rahega. iske baad wo sahib baith gaey aur der tak baithey rahe phir khadey huey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein wapas jatey huey dekha aur unhein bulaney ke liye farmaya, unhein bulaya gaya. jab wo aaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya ke tumharey paas Quran Majeed kitna hai. unhon-ne arz kya falan-falan soortein . unhon-ne un Suraton ko ginaayaa . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum un Suraton ko zabani padh letey ho. unhon-ne haan mein jawab diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya ke jao maine us khatun ko tumharey nikah mein us Quran ki wjah se diya jo tumharey paas hai. un Suraton ko usey yad kara do."
"5127","aur unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne khabar di ke zamane jahiliyat mein nikah char tarah hotey they. aik sura to yahi thi jaisey aaj-kal log kartey hain, aik shakhs doosrey shakhs ke paas uski zer parwarish ladki ya uski beti ke nikah ka paigham bhejta aur uska mehar de kar us se nikah kar letaa. doosra nikah ye tha ke koi shauhar apni biwi se jab wo haiz se paak ho jati to kehta to falan shakhs ke paas chali ja aur us se munh kala kara ley us muddat mein shauhar us se juda rehta aur usey chhootaa bhi nahi. phir jab us ghair mard se uska hamal zahir ho jata jis se wo aarizii taur par sohbat karti rahtii, to hamal ke zahir honey ke baad uska shauhar agar chahta to us se sohbat karta. aisa isliye kartey they taake unka ladka sharif aur umda paida ho. ye nikah ''istibzaa'' kahlaataa tha. teesri qism nikah ki ye thi ke chand aadmi jo tadaad mein das se kam hotey kisi aik aurat ke paas aana jana rakhtey aur us se sohbat kartey. phir jab wo aurat haamla hoti aur bachcha jantii to bachcha paida ho janey par chand din guzarney ke baad wo aurat apne un tamam mardon ko bulaatii. us mauqe par unmein se koi shakhs inkar nahi kar sakta tha. chunanche wo sab us aurat ke paas jama ho jatey aur wo unse kehti ke jo tumhara mamla tha wo tumhen malum hai aur ab maine ye bachcha janaa hai. phir wo kehti ke aey fulaan! ye bachcha tumhara hai. wo jiska chahti naam ley deti aur wo ladka usi ka samjha jata, wo shakhs us se inkar ki jur'at nahi kar sakta tha. chotha nikah us taur par tha ke bahut se log kisi aurat ke paas aaya jaya kartey they. aurat apne paas kisi bhi aaney waley ko rokti nahi thi. ye kasbiyaan hoti thin. is tarah ki auratein apne darwazon par jhandey lagaey rehti thin jo nishani samjhey jatey they. jo bhi chahta unke paas jata. is tarah ki aurat jab haamla hoti aur bachcha jantii to uske paas aaney janey waley jama hotey aur kisi qiyaafa jaanney waley ko bulatey aur bachche ka naak-naqsha jisse milta jultaa hota us aurat ke us ladkey ko usi ke sath mansub kar detey aur wo bachcha usi ka betaa kaha jata, us se koi inkar nahi karta tha. phir jab Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) haq ke sath rasool ho kar tashrif laey aap ne jahiliyat ke tamam nikaahon ko baatil qarar de diya sirf us nikah ko baqi rakha jiska aaj kal riwaaj hai."
"5128","aayat (وما يتلى عليكم في الكتاب في يتامى Nisa اللاتي لا تؤتونهن ما كتب لهن وترغبون أن تنكحوهن) yaanii ''wo ( aayatein bhi) jo tumhen kitab ke andar un yateem ladkon ke barey mein padh kar sunai jati hain jinhein tum wo nahi detey ho jo unke liye muqarrar ho chuka hai aur us se bezaar ho ke unka kisi se nikah karo.'' aisi yateem ladki ke barey mein nazil hui thi jo kisi shakhs ki parwarish mein ho. mumkin hai ke uske maal w jaaidaad mein bhi Sharik ho, wahi ladki ka zyada haqdaar hai lekin wo us se nikah nahi karna chahta albatta uske maal ki wjah se usey rokey rakhta hai aur kisi doosrey mard se uski shadi nahi honey deta kyonke wo nahi chahta ke koi doosra uske maal mein hisse daar baney."
"5129","jab Hafsa binte- umr (Raziallahu anhu) ibne- Huzafa Sehmi se bewa huin. ibne- Huzafa (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab mein se they aur badr ki jang mein Sharik they unki wafat Madina Munawra mein hui thi to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke main Usman-bin-Affan (Raziallahu anhu) se mila aur unhein pesh kash! ki aur kaha ke agar aap chaahein to main Hafsa ka nikah aap se karun. unhon-ne jawab diya ke main is maamle mein ghaur karunga. chand din maine intizar kya iske baad wo mujh se miley aur kaha ke main is nateeje par pahuncha hun ke abhi nikah na karun. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir main Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se mila aur unse kaha ke agar aap chaahein to main Hafsa ka nikah aap se karun."
"5130","aayat ( فلا تعضلوهن‏ ( ki tafseer mein bayan kya ke mujh se Ma'qil-bin-Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke ye aayat mere hi barey mein nazil hui thi maine apni aik behan ka nikah aik shakhs se kar diya tha. us ne usey talaaq de di lekin jab iddat poori hui to wo shakhs ( Abul-Badaah ( meri behan se phir nikah ka paigham lekar aaya. maine us se kaha ke maine tum se iska (apni behan (ka nikah kya usey tumhari biwi banaya aur tumhen izzat di lekin tum ne usey talaaq dedii aur ab phir tum nikah ka paigham lekar aaey ho. hargiz nahi, Allah ki qism ! ab main tumhen kabhi usey nahi doonga . wo shakhs Abul-Badaah kuchh bura aadmi na tha aur aurat bhi iske yahan wapas jana chahti thi isliye Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil ki) فلا تعضلوهن‏ (ke ''tum aurton ko mat roko '' maine arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! ab main kar doonga . bayan kya ke phir unhon-ne apni behan ka nikah us shakhs se kar diya."
"5131","aayat ( ويستفتونك في Nisa قل الله يفتيكم فيهن‏ ( ''aur aap se aurton ke barey mein masla poochhtey hain, aap keh dijiye ke Allah unke barey main tumhen masla bataataa hai.'' aakhir aayat tak farmaya ke ye aayat yateem ladki ke barey mein nazil hui, jo kisi mard ki parwarish mein ho. wo mard iske maal mein bhi Sharik ho aur us se khud nikah karna chahta ho aur iska nikah kisi doosrey se karna pasand na karta ho ke kahin doosra shakhs iske maal mein hissedaar na bin jaey is gharaz se wo ladki ko rokey rakhey to Allah Taala ne logon ko us se mana kya hai."
"5132","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein baithey huey they ke aik khatun aaein aur apne aapko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye pesh kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein nazar neechi uper karke dekha aur koi jawab nahi diya phir aap ke sahaba mein se aik sahabi ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! unka nikah mujh se kara dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumharey paas koi cheez hai? unhon-ne arz kya ke mere paas to kuchh nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke lohey ki anguthi bhi nahi ? unhon-ne arz kya ke lohey ki aik anguthi bhi nahi hai. albatta main apni ye chadar phaad ke aadhi unhein de doonga aur aadhi khud rakhoonga . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, tumharey paas kuchh Quran bhi hai? unhon-ne arz kya ke hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir jao maine tumhara nikah unse us Quran Majeed ki wjah se kya jo tumharey sath hai."
"5133","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab unka nikah kya to unki umr chh saal thi aur jab unse sohbat ki to us waqt unki umr nau (9) baras ki thi aur wo nau (9) baras aap ke paas rahiin."
"5134","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse nikah kya to unki umr chh saal thi aur jab unse sohbat ki to unki umr nau (9) saal thi. Hisham-bin-Urwa ne kaha ke mujhey khabar di gaee hai ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath nau (9) saal tak rahiin."
"5135","aik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha ke main apne aapko aap ke liye hiba karti hun. phir wo der tak khadi rahi. itney mein aik mard ne kaha ke agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski zarurat na ho to uska nikah mujh se farma dein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumharey paas unhein mehar mein dene ke liye koi cheez hai? usne kaha ke mere paas is tahmad ke siwa aur kuchh nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tum apna ye tahmad usko de doge to tumharey paas pahnney ke liye tahmad bhi nahi rahega. koi aur cheez talash kar lo. us mard ne kaha ke mere paas kuchh bhi nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kuchh to talash karo, aik lohey ki anguthi hi sahii ! usey wo bhi nahi mili to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, kya tumharey paas kuchh Quran Majeed hai? unhon-ne arz kya ke ji haan ! falan-falan soortein hain, un Suraton ka unhon-ne naam liya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir ham ne tera nikah us aurat se un Suraton ke ke badley kya jo tum ko yad hain."
"5136","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bewa aurat ka nikah us waqt tak na kya jaey jab tak uski ijazat na li jaey aur kunwari aurat ka nikah us waqt tak na kya jaey jab tak uski ijazat na mil jaey. sahaba ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! kunwari aurat izn kyonkar degi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uski sura ye hai ke wo khamosh reh jaey. ye khamoshi uski marzii samjhii jaeygi."
"5251","unhon-ne apni biwi (Aamna-binte-ghifaar) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane main (haalate-haiz mein) talaaq de di. Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske mutaalliq puchha : to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaho ke apni biwi se rujoo kar lein aur phir apne nikah mein baqi rakhein. jab maahwaarii (haiz) band ho jaey, phir maahwaarii aaey aur phir band ho, tab agar chaahein to apni biwi ko apne nikah mein baqi rakhein aur agar chaahein to talaaq de dein (lekin talaaq us tuhur mein) unke sath ham-bistarii se pahley hona chahiye yahi (tuhur ki) wo muddat hai jis mein Allah Taala ne aurton ko talaaq dene ka hukm diya hai."
"5252","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni biwi ko haalate-haiz mein talaaq de di. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne iska zikr Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke chahiye ke rujoo kar lein. ( Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke) maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke kya ye talaaq , talaaq samjhii jaeygi ? unhon-ne kaha ke chup reh. phir kya samjhii jaeygi ? aur Qatada ne bayan kya, unse Yunus bin Juber ne aur unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya (ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se) farmaya ke usey hukm do ke rujoo kar ley ( Yunus bin Juber ne bayan kya ke) maine poochha, kya ye talaaq talaaq samjhii jaeygi ? ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha to kya samajhta hai agar koi kisi farz ke ada karne se aajiz bin jaey ya ahmaq ho jaey. to wo farz uske zimme se saaqit ho jaaeyga? hargiz nahi."
"5253","ye talaaq jo maine haiz mein di thi mujh par shumaar ki gaee."
"5254","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kin biwi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se panah mangi thi? unhon-ne bayan kya ke mujhey Urwa-bin-Zubair ne khabar di aur unhein Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne ke Joon ki beti (Umaima ya Asma ( jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan ( nikah ke baad) laai gain aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas gaey to usne ye keh diya ke main tum se Allah ki panah maangtii hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke tum ne bahut badi cheez se panah mangi hai, apne Maikey chali jao. abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne is hadis ko Hajjaj-bin-Yosuf bin abi Muneea' se, usne bhi apne dada Abu-Munee'a ( Ubaidullah bin abi-Ziyad ( se, unhon-ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Urwa se, unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat kya hai."
"5255","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath bahar nikley aur aik baagh mein pahunchey jiska naam ''Shaut'' tha. jab wahan ja kar aur baaghon ke darmyan pahunchey to baith gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum log yahin baitho , phir baagh mein gaey, jauniya laai ja chuki thin aur unhein khajoor ke aik ghar mein utaaraa. uska naam Umaima binte- Nauman bin Sharaheel tha. unke sath aik daaya bhi unki dekh bhaal ke liye thi. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas gaey to farmaya ke apne aapko mere hawale kar de. usne kaha kya koi shahzaadii kisi aam aadmi ke liye apne aapko hawale kar sakti hai? bayan kya ke is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna shafqat ka hath unki taraf badha kar uske sar par rakha to usne kaha ke main tum se Allah ki panah maangtii hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum ne usi se panah mangi jis se panah mangi jati hai. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar hamarey paas tashrif laey aur farmaya ke abu-Usaid ! usey 2 raazqiya kapdey pehna kar usey uske ghar pahuncha aao."
"5256","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umaima-bint-Sharaaheel se nikah kya tha, phir jab wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan laai gaiin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf hath badhaya jisey usne na-pasand kya. isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke unka saman kar dein aur Raazqiya ke 2 kapdey unhein pahnney ke liye de dein."
"5257","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umaima binte- Sharaheel se nikah kya tha, phir jab wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan laai gain . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf hath badhaya jisey usne na-pasand kya. isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke unka saman kar dein aur Raazqiya ke 2 kapdey unhein pahnney ke liye de dein."
"5258","maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se arz kya : aik shakhs ne apni biwi ko us waqt talaaq di jab wo haaiza thi ( iska kya hukm ? ( is par unhon-ne kaha tum ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko jantey ho? ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni biwi ko us waqt talaaq di thi jab wo haaiza thin. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey, iske mutaalliq aap se poochha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke) ibne-Umar us waqt apni biwi se) raj'at (apni bevi ki taaf palat jaayein) kar lein, phir jab wo haiz se paak ho jayen to us waqt agar ibne-Umar chaahein, unhein talaaq dein. maine arz kya : kya usey bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne talaaq shumaar kya tha? ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha agar koi aajiz hai aur himaaqat ka saboot de to uska ilaaj hai."
"5259","Uwemir Ajlani (Raziallahu anhu) Aasim bin Adi Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur unse kaha ke aey Aasim! tumhara kya khayal hai, agar koi apni biwi ke sath kisi ghair ko dekhey to kya usey wo qatl kar sakta hai? lekin phir tum qisaas mein usey ( shauhar ko) bhi qatl kar doge ya phir wo kya karega? Aasim mere liye ye masla aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochh dijiye. Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye masla puchha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un sawalat ko na-pasand farmaya aur is silsiley main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kalimaat Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) par nagawar guzrey aur jab wo wapas apne ghar aagey to Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) ne aa kar unse puchha ke bataiye aap se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaayaa? Aasim ne is par kaha tum ne mujh ko aafat mein dala. jo sawal tum ne puchha tha wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko na-gawar guzra . Uwemir ne kaha ke Allah ki qism ! ye masla Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochhey baghair mein baaz nahi aaoonga . chunanche wo rawaana huey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pahunchey . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ke darmyan mein tashrif rakhtey they. Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! agar koi shakhs apni biwi ke sath kisi ghair ko pa leta hai to aap ka kya khayal hai? kya wo usey qatl kar de ? lekin is sura mein aap usey qatl kar dengey ya phir usey kya karna chahiye ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne tumhari biwi ke barey mein wahi nazil ki hai, isliye tum jao aur apni biwi ko bhi sath laao. Sehal ne bayan kya ke phir donon ( miyan biwi ( ne liaan kya. logon ke sath mein bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath us waqt maujood tha. liaan se jab donon farigh huey to Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! agar iske baad bhi mein usey apne paas rakhoon to ( iska matlab ye hoga ke) mein jhoota hun. chunanche unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se pahley hi apni biwi ko teen talaaq di. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke phir liaan karne waley ke liye yahi tariqa jari ho gaya."
"5260","mujhey Urwa-bin-Zubair ne khabar di aur unhein Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne khabar di ke Rifaa qarzii (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Rifaa ne mujhey talaaq de di thi aur talaaq bhi baain, phir maine iske baad Abdur-Rehman bin Zuber qarzii (Raziallahu anhu) se nikah kar liya lekin unke paas to kapdey ke pallu jaisa hai (yani wo naa-mard hain). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ghaaliban tum Rifaa ke paas dobara jana chahti ho lekin aisa us waqt tak nahi ho sakta jab tak tum apne maujooda shauhar ka mazaa na chakh lo aur wo tumhara maza na chakh ley."
"5261","aik sahib ne apni biwi ko teen talaaq de di thi. unki biwi ne dusri shadi kar li, phir doosrey shauhar ne bhi) ham-bistarii se pahley) unhein talaaq de di. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawal kya gaya ke kya pahlaa shauhar ab unke liye halal hai (ke unse dobara shadi kar lein). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, yahan tak ke wo yani shauhar saanii uska maza chakhey jaisa ke pahley ne maza chakhaa tha."
"5262","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein ikhtiyar diya tha aur ham ne Allah aur uske rasool ko hi pasand kya tha lekin iska hamarey haq mein koi shumaar ( talaaq ( mein nahi hua tha."
"5263","maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se '' ikhtiyar '' ke mutaalliq sawal kya to unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein ikhtiyar diya tha to kya mahz ye ikhtiyar talaaq bin jata. Masruq ne kaha ke ikhtiyar dene ke baad agar tum mujhey pasand kar leti ho to uski koi haisiyat nahi, chahey mein aik martaba ikhtiyar dun ya so martaba ( talaaq nahi hogi) ."
"5264","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se agar aisey shakhs ka masla puchha jata jisne apni biwi ko teen talaaq di hoti, to wo kehtey agar to aik baar ya 2 baar talaaq deta to rujoo kar sakta tha kyonke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh ko aisa hi hukm diya tha lekin jab tu ney teen talaaq de di to wo aurat ab tujh par haram ho gaee yahan tak ke wo terey siwa aur kisi shakhs se nikah kare."
"5265","aik shakhs Rifaaii ne apni biwi ( tameema binte- Wahab ( ko talaaq de di, phir aik doosrey shakhs se unki biwi ne nikah kya lekin unhon-ne bhi unko talaaq de di. un doosrey shauhar ke paas kapdey ke pallu ki tarah tha. aurat ko us se pura maza jaisa wo chahti thi nahi mila. aakhir Abdur-Rehman ne thodey hi dinon rakh kar usko talaaq de di. ab wo aurat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aai aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! mere shauhar ne mujhey talaaq de di thi, phir maine aik doosrey mard se nikah kya. wo mere paas tanhai mein aaey lekin unke sath to kapdey ke pallu ki tarah ke siwa aur kuchh nahi hai. kal aik hi baar us ne mujh se sohbat ki wo bhi bekaar (dukhool hi nahi hua uper hi uper chhu kar reh gaya) kya ab main apne pahley khawind ke liye halal ho gaee ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke to apne pahley khawind ke liye halal nahi ho sakti jab tak doosra khawind teri sheernii na chakhey."
"5266","agar kisi ne apni biwi ko apne uper haram kaha to ye koi cheez nahi aur farmaya ke tumharey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki pairwi umda pairwi hai."
"5267","maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ummul-Momenin Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan thahartey they aur unke yahan shehad piyaa kartey they. chunanche maine aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne mil kar salaah ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham mein se jiske yahan bhi tashrif laaein to aap se ye kaha jaey ke aap ke munh se maghaafeer (eik khas qism ke badbudar gond) ki mahak aati hai, kya aap ne maghaafeer khaya hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske baad ham mein se aik ke yahan tashrif laey to unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi baat kahi . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi balke maine Zenab binte-Jahash ke yahan shehad piyaa hai, ab dobara nahi piyunga. is par ye aayat nazil huii ( ya أيها النبي لم تحرم ما أحل الله لك‏ ) ke ''aey Nabi ! aap wo cheez kyon haram kartey hain jo Allah ne aap ke liye halal ki hai.'' se ( ‏‏‏‏إن تتوبا إلى الله‏ ( tak. ye Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf Khattab hai (وإذ أسر النبي إلى بعض أزواجه) . hadis se aap ka yahi farmana murad hai ke maine maghaafeer nahi khaya balke shehad piyaa hai."
"5268","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) shehad aur meethii cheezein pasand kartey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Asr ki Namaz se farigh ho kar jab wapas aatey to apni beeviyon ke paas wapas tashrif ley jatey aur kuchh se qareeb bhi hotey they. aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hafsa-binte-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas tashrif le gaey aur mamool (routine) se zyada der unke ghar thahrey. mujhey is par ghairat aai aur maine iske barey mein puchha to malum hua ke Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ko unki qaum ki kisi khatun ne unhein shehad ka aik dabba diya hai aur unhon-ne usi ka sharbat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye pesh kya hai. maine apne ji mein kaha : Allah ki qism ! main to aik heela karoongii, phir maine Sauda-binte-Zama (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumharey paas aaeingey aur jab aaein to kehna ke malum hota hai aap ne maghaafeer kha rakha hai? zahir hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske jawab mein inkar karengey. us waqt kehna ke phir ye boo kaisi hai jo aap ke munh se malum kar rahi hoon? is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kahengey ke Hafsa ne shehad ka sharbat mujhey pilaya hai. tum kehna ke ghaaliban us shehad ki makkhii ne maghaafeer ke darakht ka arq choosaa hoga. mein bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi kahoongii aur Safiya tum bhi yahi kehna . Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Sauda (Raziallahu anha) kehti thin ke Allah ki qism ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) junhii darwazey par aa kar khadey huey to tumharey khof se maine irada kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se wo baat kahun jo tum ne mujh se kahi thi. chunanche jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Sauda (Raziallahu anha) ke qareeb tashrif le gaey to unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! kya aap ne maghaafeer khaya hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. unhon-ne kaha, phir ye bo kaisi hai jo aap ke munh se mehsus karti hoon? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Hafsa ne mujhey shehad ka sharbat pilaya hai. is par Sauda (Raziallahu anha) boliin us shehad ki makkhii ne maghaafeer ke darakht ka arq choosaa hoga. phir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laey to maine bhi yahi baat kahi iske baad jab Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan tashrif le gaey to unhon-ne bhi usi ko dohraya . iske baad jab phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan tashrif le gaey to unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! wo shehad phir nosh farmaaein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey uski zarurat nahi hai. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke is par Sauda boliin, Allah ki qism ! ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko rokney mein kaamyaab ho gaey, maine unse kaha ke abhi chup raho."
"5269","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne meri ummat ko burey khayalat ki had tak maaf kya hai, jab tak ke is par amal na karey ya usey zaban se ada na kare. Qatada (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke agar kisi ne apne dil mein talaaq de di to uska eitibaar nahi hoga jab tak zaban se na kahey ."
"5270","qabila Aslam ke aik sahib Maaiz naam ke masjid main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke unhon-ne zina kya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse munh mod liya lekin phir wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney aagey (aur zina ka iqrar kya ( phir unhon-ne apne uper char martaba shahadat di to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein mukhaatab kartey huey farmaya ke tum paagal to nahi ho, kya waqei tum ne zina kya hai? unhon-ne arz kya ke ji haan , phir aap ne puchha kya to shadi shuda hai? usne kaha ke ji haan ho chuki hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein eidgaah par rajm (sangsaar) karne ka hukm diya. jab unhein patthar laga to wo bhaagney lagey lekin unhein Harra ke paas pakda aur jaan se mar diya gaya."
"5272","mujhey aik aisey shakhs ne khabar di jinhoney Jabir-bin-Abdullah Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se suna tha ke unhon-ne bayan kya ke main bhi un logon mein tha jinhoney un sahabi ko sangsaar kya tha. ham ne Madina Munawra ki eidgaah par sangsaar kya tha. jab un par patthar padaa to wo bhaagney lagey lekin ham ne unhein Harra mein phir pakad liya aur unhein sangsaar kya yahan tak ke wo mar gaey."
"5273","Saabit-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! mujhey unke akhlaq aur Deen ki wjah se unse koi shikayat nahi hai. albatta mein Islam mein kufr ko pasand nahi karti . (kyonke unke sath reh kar unke huquq zaujiyat ko nahi ada kar sakti ( . is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke kya tum unka baagh (jo unhon-ne mehar mein diya tha) wapas kar sakti ho? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) se) farmaya ke baagh qabool kar lo aur unhein talaaq de do."
"5274","aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya tha ke kya tum un ( Sabit (Raziallahu anhu)) ka baagh wapas kar dogii? unhon-ne arz kya haan kar doongii. chunanche unhon-ne baagh wapas kar diya aur unhon-ne unke shauhar ko hukm diya ke unhein talaaq de dein. aur Ibrahim bin tahmaan ne bayan kya ke unse Khalid ne, unse Ikrima ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur (is riwayat mein bayan kya ke) unke shauhar ( Sabit (Raziallahu anhu)) ne unhein talaaq de di."
"5275","Saabit-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mujhey Sabit ke Deen aur unke akhlaq ki wjah se koi shikayat nahi hai lekin main unke sath guzaara nahi kar sakti . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke phir kya tum unka baagh wapas kar sakti ho? unhon-ne arz kya ji haan."
"5276","Sabit bin Qais-bin Shamas (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaiin aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Sabit ke Deen aur unke akhlaq se mujhey koi shikayat nahi lekin mujhey khatrah hai (ke mein Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) ki na-shukri mein na phans jaaun). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par unse malum farmaya ke kya tum unka baagh (jo unhon-ne mehar mein diya tha) wapas kar sakti ho? unhon-ne arz kya ji haan. chunanche unhon-ne wo baagh wapas kar diya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein apne se juda kar diya."
"5277","unse Ikrima ne yahi qissa (mursalan) naql kya aur is mein khatun ka naam jameela aaya hai."
"5278","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke bani Mughira ne uski ijazat mangi hai ke Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se wo apni beti ka nikah kar lein lekin main unhein uski ijazat nahi doonga ."
"5279","Barira (Raziallahu anhu) se Deen ke teen masley malum ho gaey. awwal ye ke unhein aazad kya gaya aur phir unke shauhar ke barey mein ikhtiyar diya gaya (ke chaahein unke nikah mein rahen warna alag ho jayen (aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (unhein ke barey mein) farmaya ke 'walaa' usi se qaaim hoti hai jo aazad karey aur aik martaba Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghar mein tashrif laey to aik handi mein gosht pakaya ja raha tha, phir khaney ke liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney roti aur ghar ka saalan pesh kya gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine to dekha ke handi mein gosht bhi paak raha hai? arz kya gaya ke ji haan lekin wo gosht Barira ko sadqe mein mila hai aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sadqa nahi khaatey . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo unke liye sadqa hai aur hamarey liye Barira ki taraf se tohfa hai."
"5280","maine unhein ghulam dekha tha. aap ki murad Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke shauhar se thi."
"5281","ye Mughees bani falan ke ghulam they. aap ka ishara Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke shauhar ki taraf tha. maano us waqt bhi main unhein dekh raha hun ke Madina ki galiyon mein wo Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke peechhey peechhey rotey phir rahe hain."
"5282","Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke shauhar aik habshi ghulam they. unka Mughees naam tha, wo bani falan ke ghulam they. jaisey wo manzar ab bhi meri aankhon mein hai ke wo Madina ki galiyon mein Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke peechhey peechhey phir rahe hain."
"5283","Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke shauhar ghulam they aur unka naam Mughees tha. maano mein is waqt usko dekh raha hun jab wo Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke peechhey peechhey rotey huey phir rahe they aur aansuon se unki dadhi tar ho rahi thi. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya : Abbas ! kya tumhen Mughees ki Barira se mohabbat aur Barira ki Mughees se nafrat par hairat nahi huii? aakhir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Barira (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke kash! ! tum iske barey mein apna faisla badal detiin. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya aap mujhey iska hukm farma rahe hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main sirf sifarish kar raha hun. unhon-ne is par kaha ke mujhey Mughees ke paas rehney ki khahish nahi hai."
"5284","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko kharidney ka irada kya lekin unke maalikon ne kaha ke wo usi shart par unhein beech saktey hain ke Barira ka tarka ham lein aur unke sath 'walaa' ( aazadi ke baad) unhein se qaaim ho. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne jab iska zikr Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to aap ne farmaya ke unhein khareed kar aazad kar do. tarka to usi ko milega jo londi ghulam ko aazad karey aur 'walaa' bhi usi ke sath qaaim ho sakti hai jo aazad karey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney gosht laya gaya phir kaha ke ye gosht Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko sadqa kya gaya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo unke liye sadqa hai aur hamarey liye unka tohfa hai. ham se Aadam-bin-abii-Ayaas ne bayan kya, unse Shoba ne bayan kya aur is riwayat mein ye izafa kya ke phir (aazaadii ke baad) unhein unke shauhar ke mutaalliq ikhtiyar diya gaya (ke chaahein unke paas rahen aur agar chaahein unse apna nikah tod lein)."
"5285","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se agar Yahudi ya nasara aurton se nikah ke mutaalliq sawal kya jata to wo kehtey ke Allah Taala ne mushrik aurton se nikah mominon ke liye haram qarar diya hai aur main nahi samajhta ke us se badh kar aur kya shirk hoga ke aik aurat ye kahey ke iske rab Esa (Alaihissalam) hain halanke wo Allah ke maqbool bandon mein se aik maqbool bandey hain."
"5286","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur momineen ke liye mushrekeen 2 tarah ke they. aik to mushrekeen ladai karne walon se ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unse jang kartey they aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jang kartey they. doosrey ahad w paiman karne waley mushrekeen ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unse jang nahi kartey they aur na wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jang kartey they aur jab ahle-kitab Harab ki koi aurat (Islam qabool karne ke baad) hijrat karke (Madina Munawra ( aati to unhein us waqt tak paigham nikah na diya jata yahan tak ke unhein haiz aata aur phir wo us se paak hotin, phir jab wo paak ho jaatiin to unse nikah jaaiz ho jata, phir agar unke shauhar bhi, unke kisi doosrey shakhs se nikah kar leney se pahley hijrat karke aa jatey to ye unhiin ko miltiin aur agar mushrekeen mein se koi ghulam ya londi musalman ho kar hijrat karti to wo aazad samjhey jatey aur unke wahi huquq hotey jo tamam muhajireen ke they. phir Ata ne muaahida mushrekeen ke silsiley mein Mujahid ki hadis ki tarah se soorate-haal bayan ki ke agar muaahida mushrekeen ki koi ghulam ya londi hijrat karke aa jati to unhein unke Malik mushrekeen ko wapas nahi kya jata tha. albatta jo unki qeemat hoti wo wapas kar di jati thi."
"5287","qareeba binte- abi Umayya umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke nikah mein thin, phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne ( mushrekeen se nikah ki mukhalifat ki aayat ke baad) unhein talaaq de di to Muawiya bin abi Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse nikah kar liya aur umme-hakam binte- abi Sufiyan ayaaz bin ghanam fahrii ke nikah mein thin, us waqt us ne unhein talaaq de di (aur wo Madina hijrat karke aa gaiin) aur Abdullah-bin-Usman Saqafi ne unse nikah kya."
"5288","mujhey Urwa-bin-Zubair ne khabar di aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke momin auratein jab hijrat karke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aati thin to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein aazmaaney they b-wajah Allah Taala ke us irshad ke) ya أيها الذين آمنوا إذا جاءكم المؤمنات مهاجرات فامتحنوهن‏ (ke ''aey wo logo ! jo eman ley aaey ho, jab momin auratein tumharey paas hijrat karke aaein to unhein aazmao '' . aakhir aayat tak. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir un ( hijrat karne wali) momin aurton mein se jo us shart ka iqrar kar leti (jiska zikr isi sura al-Mumtahina mein hai ke ''Allah ka kisi ko Sharik na thahraaogii'') to wo aazmaish mein poori samjhii jati thi. chunanche jab wo iska apni zaban se iqrar kar letin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unse farmatey ke ab jao maine tum se ahad ley liya hai. hargiz nahin! Allah ki qasam! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath ne (bait letey waqt) kisi aurat ka hath kabhi nahi chhuwaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unse sirf zaban se (bait letey they). Allah ki qism ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aurton se sirf unhein chizon ka ahad liya jinka Allah ne aapko hukm diya tha. bait leney ke baad aap unse farmatey ke maine tum se ahad ley liya hai. ye aap sirf zaban se kehtey ke maine tum se bait ley li."
"5289","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni paak beeviyon se iilaa kya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paon mein moch aa gaee thi. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne bula khaane mein untees din tak qiyam farmaya, phir aap wahan se utrey. logon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah! aap ne aik mahina ka iilaa kya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mahina untees din ka bhi hota hai."
"5290","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) us iilaa ke barey mein jiska zikr Allah Taala ne kya hai, farmatey they ke muddat poori honey ke baad kisi ke liye jaaiz nahi, siwa iske ke qaayde ke mutabiq (apni biwi ko) apne paas hi rok ley ya phir talaaq de, jaisa ke Allah Taala ne hukm diya hai. aur imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke mujh se Ismail ne bayan kya ke unse Imam Malik (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne bayan kya, unse Naafe ne aur unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke char mahiney guzar jayen to usey qazi ke samney pesh kya jaeyga yahan tak ke wo talaaq dedey aur talaaq us waqt tak nahi hoti jab tak talaaq di na jaey aur Usmaan, Ali, abu-Darda aur Aaisha aur baara doosrey sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se bhi aisa hi manqul hai."
"5291","jab char mahiney guzar jayen to usey qazi ke samney pesh kya jaeyga yahan tak ke wo talaaq dedey, aur talaaq us waqt tak nahi hoti jab tak talaaq di na jaey, aur Usmaan, Ali, abu-Darda aur Aaisha aur baara doosrey sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se bhi aisa hi manqul hai."
"5292","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khoii hui bakri ke mutaalliq sawal kya gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey pakad lo, kyonke ya wo tumhari hogi (agar aik saal tak elaan ke baad iska Malik na milaa). tumharey kisi bhai ki hogi ya phir bhediye ki hogi (agar unhi jangalon mein phirtii rahii) aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khoey huey oont ke mutaalliq sawal kya gaya to aap ghussa ho gaey aur ghusse ki wjah se aap ke donon rukhsar surkh ho gaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen us se kya gharaz! uske paas ( mazbut ( khur hain ( jiski wjah se chalney mein usey koi dushwari nahi hogi) uske paas mishkeeza hai jis se wo pani peetaa rahega aur darakht ke patey khata rahega , yahan tak ke iska Malik usey pa lega aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khoi hui cheez ke mutaalliq sawal kya gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uski rassii ka (jis se wo bandhaa ho (aur uske bartan ka (jis mein wo rakha ho) elaan karo aur uska aik saal tak elaan karo, phir agar koi aisa shakhs aa jaey jo usey pehchanta ho (aur iska Malik ho to usey de do) warna usey apne maal ke sath mila lo. Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne bayan kya ke phir main Rabee bin Abdur-Rehman se mila aur mujhey unse iske siwa aur koi cheez mehfooz nahi hai. maine unse puchha tha ke gum hui chizon ke barey mein manbais ke Maula Yazeed ki hadis ke barey mein aap ka kya khayal hai? kya wo Zaid-bin-Khalid se manqul hai? to unhon-ne kaha ke haan, (Sufiyaan ne bayan kya ke yahan ( Yahya ne bayan kya ke Rabee ne manbais ke Maula Yazeed se bayan kya, unse Zaid-bin-Khalid ne. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke phir maine Rabee se mulaqat ki aur unse iske mutaalliq poochha."
"5293","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Baitullah ka tawaaf apne oont par Sawar ho kar kya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab bhi rukn ke paas aatey to uski taraf ishara karke takbeer kehtey aur Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke yaajooj maajooj ke diwar mein itna suraakh ho gaya hai aur aap ne apni ungliyon se nawwey ka adad banaya."
"5294","abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Juma mein aik ghadi aisi aati hai jo musalman bhi us waqt khada Namaz padhey aur Allah se koi khair maangey to Allah usey zaroor dega. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (is sa'at ki wazaahat kartey huey) apne hath se ishara kya aur apni ungliyon ko darmyani ungli aur chhoti ungli ke beech mein rakha jis se ham ne samjha ke aap us sa'at ko bahut mukhtasar honey ko bata rahe hain."
"5295","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein aik Yahudi ne aik ladki par zulm kya, iske chandi ke zewaraat jo wo pahney huey thi chheen liye aur iska sar kuchal diya. ladki ke ghar waley usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laey to uski zindagi ki bas aakhiri ghadi baqi thi aur wo bol nahi sakti thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se puchha ke tumhen kis ne maara hai? falan ne? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqia se ghair mutaalliq aadmi ka naam liya. isliye us ne apne sar ke ishaare se kaha ke nahi. bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik doosrey shakhs ka naam liya aur wo bhi us waaqie se ghair mutaalliq tha to ladki ne sar ke ishara se kaha ke nahi, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke falan ne tumhen maara hai? to us ladki ne sar ke ishara se haan kaha,"
"5296","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke fitna idhar se uthega aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashriq ki taraf ishara kya."
"5297","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik safar mein they. jab suraj doob gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sahabi ( Bilal (Raziallahu anhu)) se farmaya ke utar kar mere liye sattu ghol (kyonke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rozey se they) unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! agar andhera honey dein to behtar hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya ke utar kar sattu ghol . unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! agar aap aur andhera ho leney dein to behtar hai, abhi din baqi hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke utro aur sattu ghol lo. aakhir teesri martaba kehney par unhon-ne utar kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka sattu gholaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey piyaa, phir aap ne apne hath se mashriq ki taraf ishara kya aur farmaya ke jab tum dekho ke raat idhar se aa rahi hai to roze-daar ko iftaar kar lena chahiye"
"5298","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se kisi ko (sehrii khaney se) Bilal ki pukar na rokey ya aap ne farmaya ke ''unkii azaan'' kyonke wo pukaartey hain, ya farmaya, azan detey hain taake us waqt Namaz padhney wala ruk jaey. iska elaan se ye maqsud nahi hota ke subah sadiq ho gaee. us waqt Yazeed bin Zaree ne apne donon hath buland kiye (subah ki sura bataaney ke liye) phir aik hath ko doosrey par phailaayaa ( subah sadiq ki sura ke izhar ke liye) ."
"5299","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kanjoos aur data ki misal 2 aadmiyon jaisi hai jin par lohey ki 2 zirahein seeney se gardan tak hain. data jab bhi koi cheez kharch karta hai to zirah iske chamdey par dheelii ho jati hai aur uske paon ki ungliyon tak pahunch jati hai (aur phail kar itni badh jati hai ke) iske nishaane-qadam ko mitaatii chaltii hai lekin kanjoos jab bhi kharch ka irada karta hai to uski zirah ka har halqa apni apni jagah chimat jata hai, wo usey dhila karna chahta hai lekin wo dhila nahi hota. us waqt aap ne apni ungli se apne halaq ki taraf ishara kya."
"5300","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen bataaun ke qabila Ansar ka sabse behtar gharaana kon sa hai? sahaba ne arz kya ke zaroor bataiye ya Rasulullah! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke banu-Najjaar kaa. iske baad unka martaba hai jo unse qareeb hain yani banu-abdul-ash'hal ka, unke baad wo hain jo unse qareeb hain, bani al-Haaris bin khazraj kaa. iske baad wo hain jo unse qareeb hain, banu-saaida kaa. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne hath se ishara kya aur apni muththii band ki, phir usey is tarah khola jaisey koi apne hath ki cheez ko phainktaa hai phir farmaya ke Ansar ke har gharaana mein khair hai."
"5301","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahabi Sahal-bin-Sad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri bea'sat qiyamat se itni qareeb hai jaisey uski us se (yani shahadat ki ungli beech ki ungli se) ya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (raawii ko shak tha) ke jaisey ye donon ungliyan hain aur aap ne shahadat ki aur beech ki ungliyon ko mila kar bataya."
"5302","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mahina itney , itney aur itney dinon ka hota hai. aap ki murad tees din se thi. phir farmaya aur itney , itney aur itney dinon ka bhi hota hai. aap ka ishara untees dinon ki taraf tha. aik martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tees ki taraf ishara kya aur dusri martaba untees ki taraf ."
"5303","aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne hath se Yaman ki taraf ishara karke farmaya ke barkatein idhar hain. 2 martaba (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya ( haan aur dil ki sakhti unki kadak awaz walon mein hai jahan se shaitan ki donon seengein nikalti hain yani Rabee aur muzar mein."
"5304","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main aur yateem ki parwarish karne wala jannat mein is tarah hongey aur aap ne shahadat ki ungli aur beech ki ungli se ishara kya aur in donon ungliyon ke darmyan thodi si jagah khuli rakhii."
"5305","aik sahabi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! mere yahan to kala kalootaa bachcha paida hua hai. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumharey paas kuchh oont bhi hain? unhon-ne kaha ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke unke rang kaisey hain? unhon-ne kaha ke surkh rang ke hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke unmein koi siyaahii maail safaid oont bhi hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke phir ye kahan se aa gaya? unhon-ne kaha ke apni nasl ke kisi bahut pahley ke oont par ye padaa hoga. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke isi tarah tumhara ye ladka bhi apni nasl ke kisi door ke rishtedar par padaa hoga."
"5306","qabila Ansar ke aik sahabi ne apni biwi par tohmat lagai to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne donon miyan biwi se qism khilwaaii aur phir donon mein judai kara di."
"5307","Hilal bin Umayya ne apni biwi par tohmat lagaaii, phir wo aaey aur gawahi di. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqt farmaya ke Allah khub janta hai ke tum mein se aik jhoota hai, to kya tum mein se koi (jo waqei gunah ka murtakib hua ho ( rujoo karega? iske baad unki biwi khadi huin aur unhon-ne gawahi di apne barii honey ki."
"5308","Aasim aap ka kya khayal hai ke aik shakhs agar apni biwi ke sath kisi ghair mard ko dekhey to kya usey qatl kar dega lekin phir aap log usey bhi qatl kar dengey. aakhir usey kya karna chaahiye? Aasim ! mere liye ye masla poochh do. chunanche Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye masla poochha. Nabi Karim ne is tarah ke sawalat ko na-pasand farmaya aur izhar na-gawari kya. Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne is silsiley main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jo kuchh suna uska bahut asar liya. phir jab ghar wapas aaey to Uwemir unke paas aaey aur poochha. Aasim ! aapko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya jawab diya. Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, Uwemir ! tum ne mere sath achchha mamla nahi kya, jo masla tum ne puchha tha, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey na-pasand farmaya, Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qism ! jab tak mein ye masla Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se malum na kar loon , baaz nahi aaoonga . chunanche Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt sahaba ke darmyan mein maujood they. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap ka us shakhs ke mutaalliq kya irshad hai jo apni biwi ke sath kisi ghair mard ko dekhey , kya usey qatl kar de ? lekin phir aap log usey ( qisaas ( mein qatl kar dengey , to phir usey kya karna chahiye ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumharey aur tumhari biwi ke barey mein abhi wahi nazil hui hai. jao aur apni biwi ko lekar aao . Sehal ne bayan kya ke phir un donon ne liaan kya. main bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas us waqt maujood tha. jab liaan se farigh huey to Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! agar ab bhi mein usey (apni biwi ko) apne sath rakhta hun to uska matlab ye hai ke main jhoota hun. chunanche unhon-ne unhein teen talaaqein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se pahley hi de dein. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke phir liaan karne walon ke liye sunnat tariqa muqarrar ho gaya."
"5309","mujhey ibne-Shahab ne liaan ke barey mein aur ye ke shariiat ki taraf se iska sunnat tariqa kya hai, khabar di bani saaida ke Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne, unhon-ne bayan kya ke qabila Ansar ke aik sahabi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! us shakhs ke mutaalliq aap ka kya irshad hai jo apni biwi ke sath kisi ghair mard ko dekhey , kya wo usey qatl kar de ya usey kya karna chahiye ? unhiin ke barey mein Allah Taala ne Quran Majeed ki wo aayat nazil ki jis mein liaan karne walon ke liye tafseelaat bayan hui hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke Allah Taala ne tumhari biwi ke barey mein faisla kar diya hai. bayan kya ke phir donon ne masjid mein liaan kya, main us waqt wahan maujood tha. jab donon liaan se farigh huey to Ansari sahabi ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! agar ab bhi mein usey apne nikah mein rakhoon to iska matlab ye hoga ke maine is par jhooti tohmat lagai thi. chunanche liaan se farigh honey ke baad unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se pahley hi unhein teen talaaqein de din. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maujoodgii mein hi unhein juda kar diya. (Sahal ne ya ibne-Shahab ne) kaha ke har liaan karne waley miyaan-beewii ke darmyan yahi judai ka sunnat tariqa muqarrar hua. ibne-Juraij ne bayan kya, unse ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke unke baad shariiat ki taraf se tariqa ye mutaiyan hua ke 2 liaan karne walon ke darmyan tafreeq kara di jaya kare. aur wo aurat haamla thi aur unka betaa apni maa ki taraf mansub kya jata tha. bayan kya ke phir aisi aurat ke meeraas ke barey mein bhi ye tariqa shariiat ki taraf se muqarrar ho gaya ke bachcha iska waaris hoga aur wo bachche ki waaris hogi. iske mutabiq jo Allah Taala ne wiraasat ke silsile mein farz kya hai. ibne-Juraij ne bayan kya, unse ibne-Shahab ne aur unse Sahal-bin-Sad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ne, usi hadis mein ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke agar (li'aan karne wali khaatoon) us ne surkh aur pasta qad bachcha janaa jaisey وحرہ to main samjhoonga ke aurat hi sachchii hai aur uske shauhar ne is par jhooti tohmat lagai hai lekin agar kaalaa, badi aankhon wala aur badey sirinon (pushton) wala bachcha janaa to main samjhoonga ke shauhar ne iske mutaalliq sach kaha tha. (aurat jhooti hai) jab bachcha paida ho to wo buri shakl ka tha (yani us mard ki sura par jis se wo badnaam hui thi)."
"5310","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein liaan ka zikr hua aur Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne us silsile mein koi baat kahi (ke mein agar apni biwi ke sath kisi ghair mard ko dekh loon to wahin qatl kar doon) aur chaley gaey, phir unki qaum ke aik sahabi ( Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu)) unke paas aaey ye shikayat ley karke unhon-ne apni biwi ke sath aik ghair mard ko paya hai. Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujhey aaj ye aazmaish meri usi baat ki wjah se aai (jo aap ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney kahi thi). phir wo unhein lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko wo waqia bataya jis mein mulawwis us sahabi ne apni bevi ko paya tha. ye sahib zard rang, kam gosht waley (patley-dubley) aur seedhey baal waley they aur jiske mutaalliq unhon-ne dawa kya tha ke usey unhon-ne apni biwi ke sath ( tanhai mein) paya , wo gathey huey jism ka, gehunwey aur bharey gosht wala tha. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua farmai ke aey Allah ! is maamle ko saaf kar de. chunanche us aurat ne bachcha usi mard ki shakl ka janaa jiske mutaalliq shauhar ne dawa kya tha ke usey unhon-ne apni biwi ke sath paya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne miyaan-beewii ke darmyan liaan karaya. aik shagird ne majlis mein Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha kya yahi wo aurat hai jiske mutaalliq Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke agar main kisi ko bila gawahi ke sangsaar kar sakta to is aurat ko sangsaar karta. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi (ye jumla Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne) us aurat ke mutaalliq farmaya tha jiski badkaarii Islam ke zamane mein khul gaee thi. Abu-Saleh aur Abdullah-bin Yusuf ne is hadis mein bajaey ( خدلا‏ . Mina (ke kasaraa ke sath daal ( خدلا‏ . Mina ( riwayat kya hai lekin mana wahi hai."
"5311","maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aisey shakhs ka hukm puchha jisne apni biwi par tohmat lagai ho to unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bani Ajlan ke miyan biwi ke darmyan aisi sura mein judai kara di thi aur farmaya tha ke Allah khub janta hai ke tum mein se aik jhoota hai. to kya tum mein se aik (jo waqei gunah mein mubtala ho) rujoo karega lekin un donon ne inkar kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unmein judai kar di aur bayan kya ke mujh se Amr-bin-Dinar ne farmaya ke hadis ke kuchh ajzaa mera khayal hai ke maine abhi tum se bayan nahi kiye hain. farmaya ke un sahib ne (jinhon ne liaan kya tha) kaha ke mere maal ka kya hoga (jo maine mehar mein diya tha) bayan kya ke is par unse kaha gaya ke wo maal (jo aurat ko mehar mein diya tha) ab tumhara nahi raha. agar tum sachey ho (is tohmat lagaaney mein tab bhi kyonke) tum us aurat ke paas tanhai mein ja chukey ho aur agar tum jhootey ho tab to tum ko aur bhi mehar na milnaa chahiye ."
"5312","unke mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke tumhara hisab to Allah Taala ke zimme hai. tum mein se aik jhoota hai. ab tumhen tumhari biwi par koi ikhtiyar nahi. un sahabi ne arz kya ke mera maal wapas kara dijiye (jo mehar mein diya gaya thaa). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab wo tumhara maal nahi hai. agar tum iske maamle mein sachey ho to tumhara ye maal iske badle mein khatm ho chuka ke tum ne uski sharmgah ko halal kya tha aur agar tum ne is par jhooti tohmat lagai thi phir to wo tum se ba'eed tar hai. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke ye hadis maine Amr se yad ki aur Ayub ne bayan kya ke maine Saeed-bin-Jubair se suna, kaha ke maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aisey shakhs ke mutaalliq puchha jisne apni biwi se liaan kya ho to aap ne apni 2 ungliyon se ishara kya. Sufiyan ne us ishaare ko apni 2 shahadat aur beech ki ungliyon ko juda karke bataya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila bani Ajlan ke miyan biwi ke darmyan judai karaai thi aur farmaya tha ke Allah janta hai ke tum mein se aik jhoota hai, to kya wo rujoo kar lega? aap ne teen martaba ye farmaya, Ali-bin-Abdullaah madeenii ne kaha ke Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne mujh se kaha, maine ye hadis jaisey Amr-bin-Dinar aur Ayub se sun kar yad rakhi thi waisii hi tujh se bayan kar di."
"5313","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein khabar di ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us mard aur uski biwi ke darmyan judai kara di thi jinhoney apni biwi par tohmat lagai thi aur donon se qism li thi."
"5314","qabila Ansar ke aik sahib aur unki biwi ke darmyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne liaan karaya tha aur donon ke darmyan judai kara di thi."
"5315","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sahib aur unki biwi ke darmyan liaan karaya tha. phir un sahib ne apni biwi ke ladkey ka inkar kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne donon ke darmyan judai kara di aur ladka aurat ko de diya."
"5316","liaan karne walon ka zikr Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein hua to Aasim bin Adi (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par aik baat kahi (ke agar main apni biwi ke sath kisi ko paon to wahin qatl kar daalun ( phir wapas aaey to unki qaum ke aik sahib unke paas aaey aur unse kaha ke maine apni biwi ke sath aik ghair mard ko paya hai. Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us maamle mein meri ye aazmaish meri is baat ki wjah se hui hai (jiske kehney ki jur'at maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney ki thi) phir wo un sahib ko sath lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is sura se matla' kya jis mein unhon-ne apni biwi ko paya tha. ye sahib zard rang , kam gosht waley aur seedhey baalon waley they aur wo jisey unhon-ne apni biwi ke paas paya tha gehunwey rang , gathey jism ka zard , bharey gosht wala tha iske baal bahut zyada ghunghraaley they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Allah ! mamla saaf kar de chunanche unki biwi ne jo bachcha janaa wo usi shakhs se mushabeh (similar) tha jiske mutaalliq shauhar ne kaha tha ke unhon-ne apni biwi ke paas usey paya tha. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne donon ke darmyan liaan karaya. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aik shagird ne majlis mein poochha, kya ye wahi aurat hai jiske mutaalliq Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke agar main kisi ko bila shahadat sangsaar karta to usey karta ? Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi. ye dusri aurat thi jo Islam ke zamane mein ea'laaniya badkaarii kya karti thi."
"5317","Rifaa Qarzi (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik khatun se nikah kya, phir unhein talaaq de di, iske baad aik doosrey sahib ne un khatun se nikah kar liya, phir wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur apne doosrey shauhar ka zikr kya aur kaha ke wo to unke paas aatey hi nahi aur ye ke unke paas kapdey ke pallu jaisa hai) unhon-ne pahley shauhar ke sath dobara nikah ki khahish zahir ki lekin) . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, jab tak tum us (doosrey shauhar (ka mazaa na chakh lo aur ye tumhara mazaa na chakh lein."
"5318","aik khatun jo Islam laai thin aur jinka naam sabeeaa tha, apne shauhar ke sath rehti thin, shauhar ka jab intiqal hua to wo haamla thin. abu-Sanaan bin ba'kak (Raziallahu anhu) ne unke paas nikah ka paigham bheja lekin unhon-ne nikah karne se inkar kya. abu-Sanaabil ne kaha ke Allah ki qism ! jab tak iddat ki 2 muddaton mein se lambi na guzaar loongii , tumharey liye us se (jis se nikah wo karna chahti thiin) nikah karna sahi nahi hoga. phir wo ( waza' hamal ke baad) taqriban das din tak ruki rahen. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab nikah kar lo."
"5319","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke mutaalliq kya fatwa diya tha to unhon-ne farmaya ke jab mere yahan bachcha paida ho gaya to Nabi Karim ne mujhey fatwa diya ke ab main nikah kar loon."
"5320","sabeeaa Aslamiya apne shauhar ki wafat ke baad chand dinon tak haalate-nifaas mein rahiin. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aa kar unhon-ne nikah ki ijazat mangi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein ijazat di aur unhon-ne nikah kya."
"5322","Yahya-bin-Saeed bin al-Aas ne Abdur-Rehman bin-Hakam ki sahibzadi (Umra) ko talaaq de di thi aur unke bap Abdur-Rehman unhein unke (shauhar ke) ghar se ley aaey (iddat ke din guzarney se pahley) . Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko jab malum hua to unhon-ne Marwaan-bin-Hakam ke yahan , jo us waqt Madina ka ameer tha, kahlwaayaa ke Allah se daro aur ladki ko iske ghar ( jahan usey talaaq hui hai) pahuncha do. jaisa ke Sulaiman-bin-Yasar ki hadis mein hai. Marwan ne usko jawab ye diya ke ladki ke walid Abdur-Rehman bin-Hakam ne meri baat nahi maana aur Qasim-bin-Muhammad ne bayan kya ke) Marwan ne Ummul-Momenin ko ye jawab diya ke) kya aapko Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke maamle ka ilm nahi hai? ( unhon-ne bhi apne shauhar ke ghar iddat nahi guzari thi). Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne batlaya ke agar tum Fatima ke waqia ka hawale na detey tab bhi tumhara kuchh na bigadtaa (kyonke wo tumharey liye daleel nahi bin saktaa). Marwaan-bin-Hakam ne is par kaha ke agar aap ke nazdeek (Faatima (Raziallahu anhu) ka unke shauhar ke ghar se muntaqil karna ( unke aur unke shauhar ke rishta daari ke darmyan kasheedgii ki wjah se tha to yahan bhi yahi wjah kafi hai ke donon ( miyan biwi (ke darmyan kasheedgii thi."
"5324","Fatima binte- Qais , Allah se dartii nahi ! unka ishara unke us qaul ki taraf tha (ke baain talaaq wali ko) khaana khacha dena zaroori nahi jo kehti hai ke talaaq baain jis aurat par padey usey maskan aur kharcha nahi milega."
"5326","aap fulaana ( Umra binte-Hakam ( binte-Hakam ka mamla nahi dekhteen . unke shauhar ne unhein talaaq baain de di aur wo wahan se nikal aaein ( iddat guzaarey baghair ( . Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya ke jo kuchh us ne kya bahut bura kya. Urwa ne kaha aap ne Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ke waaqie ke mutaalliq nahi suna. batlaya ke uske liye is hadis ko zikr karne mein koi khair nahi hai aur ibne-abi zanaad ne Hisham se ye izafa kya hai aur unse unke walid ne bayan kya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne (Umra binte-Hakam ke maamle par) apni shadeed na-gawari ka izhar farmaya aur farmaya ke Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) to aik ujaad jagah mein thin aur uske charon taraf khof aur wahshat barastii thi, isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( wahan se muntaqil honey ki) unhein ijazat de di thi."
"5328","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ki is baat ka (ke baain talaaq wali ko khaana kharcha nahi milega ( inkar kya."
"5329","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (hijjatul-wadaa mein) kooch ka irada kya to dekha ke Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) apne khema ke darwazey par ghamgeen khadi hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke) عقرى (ya ( farmaya rawi ko shak tha) ( حلقى ( malum hota hai ke tum hamein rok dogii, kya tum ne qurbani ke din tawaaf kar liya hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir chalo."
"5330","Ma'qil-bin-Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni behan jameela ka nikah kya, phir (unke shauhar ne) unhein aik talaaq di."
"5331","Ma'qil-bin-Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) ki behan aik aadmi ke nikah mein thin, phir unhon-ne unhein talaaq de di, iske baad unhon-ne tanhai mein iddat guzari . iddat ke din jab khatm ho gaey to unke pahley shauhar ne hi phir Maaqil (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas unke liye nikah ka paigham bhejaa. Maaqil ko is par badi ghairat aai. unhon-ne kaha jab wo iddat guzaar rahi thi to usey is par qudrat thi (ke doran iddat mein rujoo kar lein lekin aisa nahi kya (aur ab mere paas nikah ka paigham bhejta hai. chunanche wo unke aur apni behan ke darmyan mein haail ho gaey. is par ye aayat nazil hui ( وإذا طلقتم Nisa فبلغن أجلهن فلا تعضلوهن‏ ( ''aur jab tum apni aurton ko talaaq de chuko aur wo apni muddat ko pahunch chukein to tum unhein mat roko.'' aakhir aayat tak phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bula kar ye aayat sunai to unhon-ne zid chhod di aur Allah ke hukm ke samney jhuk gaey."
"5332","unhon-ne apni biwi ko aik talaaq di to us waqt wo haaiza thin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko hukm diya ke rujoo' kar lein aur unhein us waqt tak apne sath rakhein jab tak wo us haiz se paak honey ke baad phir dobara haaiza na hun. us waqt bhi unse koi baat-cheet na karein aur jab wo us haiz se bhi paak ho jayen to agar us waqt unhein talaaq dene ka irada ho to tuhur mein us se pahley ke unse ham-bistarii karein, talaaq dein. to yahi wo waqt hai jiske mutaalliq Allah Taala ne hukm diya hai ke usmein aurton ko talaaq di jaey aur Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se agar iske (teen talaaq ke) barey mein sawal kya jata to sawal karne waley se wo kehtey ke agar tum ne teen talaaqein de di hain to phir tumhari biwi tum par haram hai. yahan tak ke wo tumharey siwa doosrey shauhar se nikah kare. (ghair Qutaiba) ke is hadis mein Leis se ye izafa kya hai ke (unhon-ne bayan kya ke) mujh se Naafe ne bayan kya aur unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar tum ne apni biwi ko aik ya 2 talaaq de di ho. (to tum usey dobara apne nikah mein la saktey ho ( kyonke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey iska hukm diya tha."
"5333","maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha to unhon-ne batlaya ke ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni biwi ko talaaq de di, us waqt wo haaiza thin. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne iske mutaalliq Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke ibne-Umar apni biwi se rujoo kar lein. phir jab talaaq ka sahi waqt aaey to talaaq dein ( Yunus bin Juber ne bayan kya ke ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se) maine puchha ke kya is talaaq ka bhi shumaar hua tha? unhon-ne batlaya ke agar koi talaaq dene wala shara' ke ehkaam bajaa laney se aajiz ho ya ahmaq bewaqoof ho (to kya talaaq nahi padegii?) ."
"5334","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas us waqt gaee jab unke walid Abu-Sufiyan bin Harab (Raziallahu anhu) ka intiqal hua tha. Umme-Habiba ne khushbu mangwai jis mein khalooq khushbu ki zardi ya kisi aur cheez ki milawat thi, phir wo khushbu aik londi ne unko lagai aur Ummul-Momenin ne khud apne rukhsaaron par usey lagaya. iske baad kaha ke Allah ki qasam! mujhey khushbu ke istemal ki koi khahish nahi thi lekin maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho jaaiz nahi ke wo teen din se zyada kisi ka sog manaaey siwa shauhar ke (ke iska sog ( char mahiney das din ka hai."
"5335","iske baad mein Ummul-Momenin Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan us waqt gaee jab unke bhai ka intiqal hua. unhon-ne bhi khushbu mangwai aur istemal kya kaha ke Allah ki qism ! mujhey khushbu ke istemal ki koi khahish nahi thi lekin maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko member par ye farmatey suna hai ke kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho ye jaaiz nahi ke kisi maiyat par teen din se zyada sog manaaey, sirf shauhar ke liye char mahiney das din ka sog hai."
"5336","aik khatun Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaein aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! meri ladki ke shauhar ka intiqal ho gaya hai aur uski aankhon mein takleef hai to kya wo surma laga sakti hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke nahi, 2 teen martaba (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya (har martaba ye farmatey they ke nahi ! phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye ( sharaee iddat ( char mahiney aur das din hi ki hai. jahiliyat main to tumhen saal bhar tak mengni phenknii padtii thi (jab kahin iddat se bahar hoti thi)."
"5337","iska kya matlab hai ke ''saal bhar tak mengni phenknii padtii thi? '' unhon-ne farmaya ke zamane jahiliyat mein jab kisi aurat ka shauhar mar jata to wo aik bahut hi zyada tang w taareek kothhrii mein dakhil ho jati. sabse burey kapdey pahantii aur khushbu ka istemal tark kar deti. yahan tak ke usi haalat mein aik saal guzar jata phir kisi chaupaaey gadhey ya bakri ya parinde ko uske paas laya jata aur wo iddat se bahar aaney ke liye is par hath phertii. aisa kam hota tha ke wo kisi janwar par hath pher de aur wo mar na jaey. iske baad wo nikaalii jati aur usey mengni di jati jisey wo phainktii. ab wo khushbu wghaira koi bhi cheez istemal kar sakti thi. Imam Malik se puchha gaya ke) تفتض به (ka kya matlab hai to aap ne farmaya wo uska jism chhootii thi."
"5338","aik aurat ke shauhar ka intiqal ho gaya, iske baad uski aankh mein takleef hui to iske ghar waley Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aap se surma lagaaney ki ijazat mangi . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke surma ( zamana iddat mein) na lagaao .) zamana jahiliyat mein) tumhen badtareen kapdey mein waqt guzaarnaa padta tha, ya ( rawi ko shak tha ke ye farmaya ke) badtareen ghar mein waqt ( iddat ( guzaarnaa padta tha. jab is tarah aik saal pura ho jata to uske paas se kutta guzarta aur wo is par mengni phainktii (jab iddat se bahar aati ( to surma na lagaao . yahan tak ke char mahiney das din guzar jaaein."
"5339","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aik musalman aurat jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho. uske liye jaaiz nahi ke wo kisi (ki wafat (ka sog teen din se zyada manaaey siwa shauhar ke ke uske liye char mahiney das din hain."
"5340","hamein mana kya gaya hai ke shauhar ke siwa kisi ka sog teen din se zyada manaaein ."
"5341","hamein us se mana kya gaya ke kisi maiyat ka teen din se zyada sog manaaein siwa shauhar ke ke uske liye char mahiney das din ki iddat thi. is arse mein ham na surma lagaatey na khushbu istemal kartey aur na ranga kapda pahntey they. albatta wo kapda us se alag tha jiska (dhaagaa) banney se pahley hi rang diya gaya ho. hamein uski ijazat thi ke agar koi haiz ke baad ghusl karey to us waqt azfaar ka thoda sa aud istemal kar ley aur hamein janaaze ke peechhey chalney ki bhi manaahii thi."
"5342","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo aurat Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho uske liye jaaiz nahi ke teen din se zyada kisi ka sog manaaey siwa shauhar ke wo iske sog mein na surma lagaey na ranga hua kapda pahney magar Yaman ka dhaarii daar kapda (jo banney se pahley hi ranga gaya ho ( ."
"5343","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke) kisi maiyat par) khawind ke siwa teen din se zyada sog karne se aur) farmaya ke) khushbu ka istemal na karey, siwa tuhur ke waqt jab haiz se paak ho to thoda sa ud ( qist (aur ( maqam ( azfaar (ki khushbu istemal kar sakti hai) , abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( kehtey hain ke) qist (aur ( الكست ( aik hi cheez hain, jaisey '' kaafoor ''aur ''qaafoor'' donon aik hain."
"5344","aayate-karima ( والذين يتوفون منكم ويذرون أزواجا‏ ( الخ , yani ''aur jo log tum mein se wafat pa jayen aur beeviyan chhod jaaein. '' ke mutaalliq kaha ke ye iddat jo shauhar ke ghar walon ke paas guzari jati thi, pahley wajib thi, isliye Allah Taala ne ye aayat utaarii والذين يتوفون منكم ويذرون أزواجا وصية لأزواجهم متاعا إلى الحول غير إخراج فإن خرجن فلا جناح عليكم فيما فعلن في أنفسهن من معروف yaanii ''aur jo log tum mein se wafat pa jayen aur beeviyan chhod jayen (un par lazim hai ke) apni beeviyon ke haq mein nafa uthaney ki wasiiyat kar jayen ke wo aik saal tak ( ghar se) na nikaalii jayen lekin agar wo ( khud ( nikal jayen to koi gunah tum par nahiin '' is barey mein jisey wo ( beeviyan ( apne barey mein dastoor ke mutabiq karein. Mujahid ne kaha ke Allah Taala ne aisi bewa ke liye saat (7) mahiney bees din saal bhar mein se wasiiyat qarar di. agar wo chahey to shauhar ki wasiiyat ke mutabiq wahin thahrii rahe aur agar chahey (chaar mahiney das din ki iddat) poori karke wahan se chali jaey. Allah Taala ke irshad ( إخراج فإن خرجن فلا جناح عليكم‏ ( tak yani '' unhein nikala na jaey. albatta agar wo khud chali jayen to tum par koi gunah nahi. '' ka yahi mansha hai. to iddat to jaisi ke pahley thi, ab bhi is par wajib hai. ibne-abi najeeh ne usey Mujahid se bayan kya aur Ata ne bayan kya ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us pehli aayat ne bewa ko khawind ke ghar mein iddat guzarney ke hukm ko mansukh kar diya, isliye ab wo jahan chahey iddat guzaarey aur (isii tarah is aayat ne) Allah Taala ke irshad (ghair ikhraaj) yani '' unhein nikala na jaaey.'' (ko bhi mansukh kar diya hai). Ata ne kaha ke agar wo chahey to apne (shauhar ke) ghar walon ke yahan hi iddat guzaarey aur wasiiyat ke mutabiq qiyam karey aur agar chahey wahan se chali aaey kyonke Allah Taala ne farmaya hai) فلا جناح عليكم فيما فعلن‏ ( الخ , yani '' to tum par iska koi gunah nahi, jo wo apni marzii ke mutabiq karein. '' Ata ne kaha ke iske baad meeraas ka hukm nazil hua aur us ne makan ke hukm ko mansukh kar diya. to wo jahan chahey iddat guzaar sakti hai aur uske liye ( shauhar ki taraf se) makan ka intizam nahi hoga."
"5345","jab unke walid ki wafat ki khabar pahunchi to unhon-ne khushbu mangwai aur apne donon baazuon par lagai phir kaha ke mujhey khushbu ki koi zarurat na thi lekin maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke jo aurat Allah aur aakhirat par eman rakhti ho wo kisi maiyat ka teen din se zyada sog na manaaey siwa shauhar ke ke uske liye char mahiney das din hain."
"5346","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuttey ki qeemat, kaahin ki kamaaii aur zaaniya aurat ke zina ki kamaaii khaney se mana farmaya,"
"5347","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne godney wali aur gudwaaney wali , sood khaney waley aur khilaaney waley par laanat bheji aur aap ne kuttey ki qeemat aur zaaniya ki kamaaii khaney se mana farmaya aur tasweer banaaney walon par laanat ki."
"5348","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laundiyon ke zina ki kamaaii se mana farmaya,"
"5349","maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aisey shakhs ke barey mein sawal kya jisne apni biwi par tohmat lagai ho to unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila bani Ajlan ke miyan biwi mein judai kara di thi aur farmaya tha ke Allah khub janta hai ke tum mein se aik jhoota hai, to kya wo rujoo karega? lekin donon ne inkar kya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dobara farmaya ke Allah khub janta hai usey jo tum mein se aik jhoota hai wo tauba karta hai ya nahi ? lekin donon ne phir tauba se inkar kya. to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unmein judai kara di. Ayub ne bayan kya ke mujh se Amr-bin-Dinar ne kaha ke haan, hadis mein aik cheez aur hai maine tumhen usey bayan kartey nahi dekha. wo ye hai ke) tohmat lagaaney waale) shauhar ne kaha tha ke mera maal ( mehar ( dilwaa dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke wo tumhara maal hi nahi raha, agar tum sachey bhi ho to tum us se khilwat kar chukey ho aur agar jhootey ho tab to tum ko kuchh milnaa hi nahi chahiye ."
"5350","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne liaan karne waley miyan biwi se farmaya ke tumhara hisab Allah ke yahan hoga. tum mein se aik to yaqinan jhoota hai. tumharey yani ( shauhar ke) liye usey ( biwi ko) hasil karne ka ab koi rasta nahi hai. shauhar ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mera maal ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab wo tumhara maal nahi raha. agar tum ne iske mutaalliq sach kaha tha to wo iske badle mein hai ke tum ne uski sharmgah apne liye halal ki thi aur agar tum ne is par jhooti tohmat lagai thi tab to aur zyada tujh ko kuchh na milnaa chahiye ."